WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Downloaded from CINEFREAK.NET

00:01:32.720 --> 00:01:35.511
<i>[Narrator] Like every major Indian city,</i>

00:01:35.720 --> 00:01:41.845
<i>balancing its present with one foot
in the past and the other in the future,</i>

00:01:42.011 --> 00:01:44.970
<i>this is Lucknow, the city of Nawabs.</i>

00:01:49.761 --> 00:01:53.761
<i>And every street and alley
here has a story to tell.</i>

00:01:55.511 --> 00:01:57.260
<i>One such story belongs</i>

00:01:57.261 --> 00:02:01.136
<i>to this mansion-like house,
Dubey Niwas, in the Chowk area.</i>

00:02:19.136 --> 00:02:21.010
<i>And this is Ranjan Dubey.</i>

00:02:21.011 --> 00:02:22.595
<i>Aka brother Mintu.</i>

00:02:22.761 --> 00:02:25.094
<i>The sole occupant of this Dubey Niwas.</i>

00:02:25.095 --> 00:02:26.010
<i>Age forty.</i>

00:02:26.011 --> 00:02:27.510
<i>And by marital status,</i>

00:02:27.511 --> 00:02:30.220
<i>he's the most eligible bachelor
of the street.</i>

00:02:30.386 --> 00:02:34.219
<i>still single and happily unmarried.</i>

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:36.553
<i>That's because he spent his entire youth
getting his three sisters,</i>

00:02:36.720 --> 00:02:41.511
<i>Babita, Babli and Pinky, married off.</i>

00:02:42.011 --> 00:02:44.136
<i>His mother passed away
when he was a child,</i>

00:02:44.345 --> 00:02:46.636
<i>and after his father's demise,</i>

00:02:46.761 --> 00:02:48.594
<i>Mr. Ranjan took his place</i>

00:02:48.595 --> 00:02:51.261
<i>as a government clerk
in the electricity department.</i>

00:02:53.511 --> 00:02:57.011
<i>When his sisters lived with him,
Mr. Ranjan ruled the roost.</i>

00:02:57.470 --> 00:03:02.595
<i>But now, his culinary skills are limited
to tea, rusk and hotchpotch.</i>

00:03:05.761 --> 00:03:08.720
<i>Ever since his youngest sister,
Pinky, got married,</i>

00:03:08.886 --> 00:03:12.136
<i>Mr. Dubey has been living
a true bachelor life.</i>

00:03:12.386 --> 00:03:14.469
<i>Whatever spot he takes off his pyjamas
in the morning,</i>

00:03:14.470 --> 00:03:17.511
<i>he returns to the same spot at night
and slips them back on.</i>

00:03:55.636 --> 00:03:59.261
<i>Mr. Ranjan had always
been timid and reserved,</i>

00:03:59.470 --> 00:04:01.511
<i>and had never had an affair.</i>

00:04:02.011 --> 00:04:06.720
<i>He considered his sisters both
his good fortune and his responsibility.</i>

00:04:07.011 --> 00:04:11.761
<i>That is why marriage
never crossed his mind.</i>

00:04:13.261 --> 00:04:15.345
<i>But these days,
his sisters have been pressuring him,</i>

00:04:15.511 --> 00:04:17.344
<i>saying that he is crossing the age.</i>

00:04:17.345 --> 00:04:18.636
<i>He should get married.</i>

00:04:18.761 --> 00:04:20.261
<i>And bring a sister-in-law home.</i>

00:04:20.886 --> 00:04:23.011
Your time isn't running out, Mr. Ranjan.

00:04:23.470 --> 00:04:24.261
It has already run out!

00:04:24.845 --> 00:04:26.886
Now, we need to check
how much mileage you can get

00:04:27.470 --> 00:04:30.011
out of whatever fuel you have left
in reserve.

00:04:30.136 --> 00:04:32.136
I just got my bike tank filled today.

00:04:32.261 --> 00:04:34.386
Not the fuel in your bike.

00:04:34.845 --> 00:04:36.761
I'm talking about you.

00:04:37.011 --> 00:04:37.970
Anyway, leave it.

00:04:38.345 --> 00:04:39.261
Don't worry.

00:04:39.511 --> 00:04:40.261
I'm there.

00:04:40.470 --> 00:04:44.761
I'll find a good life partner
for my dear friend.

00:04:45.511 --> 00:04:46.386
I promise.

00:04:46.511 --> 00:04:48.011
- [Narrator] Rajaram Pandey.
- Okay, tell me one thing.

00:04:48.511 --> 00:04:49.844
<i>[Narrator] Mr. Ranjan's neighbour</i>

00:04:49.845 --> 00:04:52.511
<i>and colleague
at the electricity department.</i>

00:04:52.761 --> 00:04:54.260
<i>He considers himself Ranjan's well-wisher</i>

00:04:54.261 --> 00:04:56.136
<i>and something of an elder brother.</i>

00:04:56.886 --> 00:04:59.595
<i>He set the ball rolling by arranging
marriage proposals for Mr. Ranjan,</i>

00:04:59.720 --> 00:05:01.511
<i>setting off a chain of events</i>

00:05:01.636 --> 00:05:06.303
<i>that shattered whatever little
confidence Ranjan had left.</i>

00:05:06.553 --> 00:05:09.511
If only we'd met sooner,

00:05:10.386 --> 00:05:13.886
I wouldn't have gone through
those two divorces!

00:05:15.011 --> 00:05:16.136
Two?

00:05:16.470 --> 00:05:17.595
But you know what they say,

00:05:17.720 --> 00:05:19.386
the third time's the charm.

00:05:19.595 --> 00:05:20.636
Fingers crossed!

00:05:23.136 --> 00:05:24.761
Age is just a number, darling.

00:05:25.136 --> 00:05:30.635
People say it's impossible to guess
my age from my skin.

00:05:30.636 --> 00:05:31.386
Yeah.

00:05:32.261 --> 00:05:34.760
Well, I may be ten years older than you,

00:05:34.761 --> 00:05:36.886
but I'm much younger at heart.

00:05:37.970 --> 00:05:39.886
I'll teach you

00:05:41.636 --> 00:05:43.470
what mature love is all about.

00:05:45.720 --> 00:05:46.760
Experience!

00:05:46.761 --> 00:05:48.511
[laughter]

00:05:48.761 --> 00:05:49.720
Hey!

00:05:50.595 --> 00:05:51.595
Just wait till I get home.

00:05:52.011 --> 00:05:54.720
I'll thrash both of you with my slippers!

00:05:56.345 --> 00:05:57.386
Stay right where you are!

00:05:59.970 --> 00:06:01.095
Sorry!

00:06:01.470 --> 00:06:02.970
They've become such little brats.

00:06:03.386 --> 00:06:04.011
Yes.

00:06:04.511 --> 00:06:06.136
You'll have to handle them yourself.

00:06:07.345 --> 00:06:09.720
Once they have a father figure
in their lives,

00:06:10.136 --> 00:06:12.261
they'll mend their ways.

00:06:13.261 --> 00:06:15.761
He can handle them just fine.
He has plenty of experience.

00:06:17.386 --> 00:06:18.095
Cool!

00:06:18.261 --> 00:06:21.469
<i>[Narrator] On seeing so much baggage
and damage in the candidate pool,</i>

00:06:21.470 --> 00:06:23.970
<i>Mr. Ranjan had practically given up.</i>

00:06:25.136 --> 00:06:28.803
<i>But at Rajaram's insistence,
he agreed to give it one last try.</i>

00:06:29.761 --> 00:06:30.761
Look, a heart...

00:06:32.095 --> 00:06:33.761
You have a government job.

00:06:35.261 --> 00:06:36.761
That's definitely a plus point.

00:06:38.011 --> 00:06:39.845
I want a secure life too.

00:06:39.970 --> 00:06:40.720
Yeah.

00:06:42.761 --> 00:06:43.595
Oh, God!

00:06:44.261 --> 00:06:44.886
What happened?

00:06:45.136 --> 00:06:46.095
My ex-husband.

00:06:46.595 --> 00:06:47.511
Where is he?

00:06:47.761 --> 00:06:48.969
What is he doing here?

00:06:48.970 --> 00:06:50.011
Where?

00:06:50.761 --> 00:06:52.720
We've just separated, damn it!

00:06:53.470 --> 00:06:54.511
We're not divorced yet!

00:06:55.720 --> 00:06:57.719
And you've already started looking
for a new match.

00:06:57.720 --> 00:06:59.220
Brother, we're from the insurance company.

00:06:59.470 --> 00:07:01.761
She's talking about getting you insured.

00:07:02.636 --> 00:07:04.470
Sir, shall I get their signature
on the document?

00:07:04.845 --> 00:07:07.261
Leave it.
Brother will get upset.

00:07:07.386 --> 00:07:08.344
Alright, sister.
We'll take your leave.

00:07:08.345 --> 00:07:09.011
Yes.

00:07:09.136 --> 00:07:10.761
<i>[Narrator] Mr. Dubey had by now realised</i>

00:07:10.886 --> 00:07:13.761
<i>- that getting married would take some time.</i>
- Come.

00:07:13.970 --> 00:07:15.344
<i>So, in the meantime,</i>

00:07:15.345 --> 00:07:18.261
<i>he hired a maid to look after the mansion.</i>

00:07:18.511 --> 00:07:19.385
<i>And now,</i>

00:07:19.386 --> 00:07:21.636
<i>- a new problem has cropped up.</i>
- Coming.

00:07:21.886 --> 00:07:23.136
Ms. Poonam.

00:07:23.595 --> 00:07:26.594
How many times have I told you
to come before 9 a.m.?

00:07:26.595 --> 00:07:28.011
Just give me two minutes, sir.

00:07:28.136 --> 00:07:29.511
Everything will be done in twenty minutes.

00:07:29.636 --> 00:07:33.470
<i>[Narrator] Those twenty minutes somehow
turned into two hours,</i>

00:07:33.636 --> 00:07:37.511
<i>and just like the past several days,
Mr. Dubey is late to work yet again.</i>

00:07:37.636 --> 00:07:39.261
Good morning, Mr. Dubey.

00:07:39.386 --> 00:07:40.386
Good morning.

00:07:40.761 --> 00:07:42.636
Good afternoon, actually! Late again?

00:07:42.845 --> 00:07:44.595
Gupta sir said he wants to meet you.

00:07:44.720 --> 00:07:45.385
Go on, go on!

00:07:45.386 --> 00:07:46.511
- Yes, yes!
- All the best!

00:07:46.636 --> 00:07:49.761
<i>[Narrator] Given the circumstances,
a new arrangement was made.</i>

00:07:49.970 --> 00:07:54.136
<i>The house keys were handed over
to Mr. Pandey's wife, Tamanna Pandey,</i>

00:07:54.511 --> 00:07:57.011
<i>so the maid could finish her work on time.</i>

00:07:57.345 --> 00:07:57.969
<i>But...</i>

00:07:57.970 --> 00:07:59.386
Look at this.

00:07:59.511 --> 00:08:02.094
The biggest mansion in our neighbourhood.

00:08:02.095 --> 00:08:04.761
And look how we've put it to use.

00:08:04.886 --> 00:08:06.510
Here's a gathering of ladies.

00:08:06.511 --> 00:08:09.719
And this lady washed clothes for
the second time and kept here for drying!

00:08:09.720 --> 00:08:13.136
And friends,
we've even made mango pickle

00:08:13.761 --> 00:08:15.511
and put poppadum out to dry.

00:08:15.636 --> 00:08:17.885
Mr. Ranjan!

00:08:17.886 --> 00:08:20.886
Guys, look at this!

00:08:21.011 --> 00:08:23.386
This is our very own Mr. Ranjan,

00:08:23.511 --> 00:08:24.760
the friendly neighbourhood hero.

00:08:24.761 --> 00:08:28.095
We didn't have a park
for the children to play in,

00:08:28.261 --> 00:08:31.595
so he threw open the doors
of his own home.

00:08:31.761 --> 00:08:33.136
What a guy!

00:08:33.261 --> 00:08:34.094
Listen, sister-in-law,

00:08:34.095 --> 00:08:36.970
I was thinking we could build
a swimming pool in the courtyard.

00:08:37.136 --> 00:08:38.844
The children could learn to swim, too.

00:08:38.845 --> 00:08:40.970
What an idea!

00:08:43.261 --> 00:08:47.636
I think we need to do something
different for you, Mr. Dubey.

00:08:47.886 --> 00:08:49.136
Something truly historic.

00:08:49.261 --> 00:08:52.136
Is everything we've done so far
not historic enough?

00:08:52.261 --> 00:08:53.386
Forget it, my dear brother.

00:08:53.595 --> 00:08:56.345
Just... just one last attempt!

00:08:56.761 --> 00:08:59.261
You don't know the magic of social media.

00:08:59.636 --> 00:09:01.969
Yes, yes. You know my needs
better than anyone else.

00:09:01.970 --> 00:09:02.553
Yeah!

00:09:02.761 --> 00:09:03.595
Yeah!

00:09:04.011 --> 00:09:05.136
Household help wanted.

00:09:05.261 --> 00:09:09.385
A hardworking property
manager-cum-housekeeper

00:09:09.386 --> 00:09:11.886
who can efficiently handle
all household chores,

00:09:12.095 --> 00:09:14.469
including cooking and cleaning.

00:09:14.470 --> 00:09:17.136
Food and accommodation
provided absolutely free.

00:09:17.511 --> 00:09:22.844
The job will be offered on a first-come,
first-served basis.

00:09:22.845 --> 00:09:25.385
Contact. Mr. Ranjan Dubey,

00:09:25.386 --> 00:09:29.636
Dubey Niwas, Kaiserbagh,
Lucknow, Uttar Pradesh.

00:09:29.761 --> 00:09:30.720
Thank you!

00:09:31.636 --> 00:09:32.886
Tomorrow's sunrise

00:09:33.386 --> 00:09:37.136
will bring a brand-new beginning
for Mr. Mintu.

00:09:39.678 --> 00:09:41.595
[doorbell rings]

00:09:41.803 --> 00:09:43.595
[knocks]

00:09:52.511 --> 00:09:54.136
I need to meet Mr. Ranjan Dubey.

00:10:02.261 --> 00:10:03.010
[doorbell rings]

00:10:03.011 --> 00:10:04.011
Oh?

00:10:05.136 --> 00:10:06.136
[knocks] Hello!

00:10:07.761 --> 00:10:08.970
[knocks] Hello!

00:10:11.720 --> 00:10:13.595
Please call Mr. Ranjan Dubey.

00:10:16.761 --> 00:10:17.761
That's me.

00:10:18.011 --> 00:10:18.970
Oh!

00:10:20.261 --> 00:10:21.386
Sir.

00:10:22.511 --> 00:10:24.136
Sir, I'm Helen.

00:10:24.595 --> 00:10:26.386
I've come all the way from Delhi
to serve you.

00:10:26.720 --> 00:10:27.761
Serve me?

00:10:28.886 --> 00:10:30.386
What kind of service?

00:10:31.345 --> 00:10:34.595
You've advertised for a property
manager-cum-housekeeper, haven't you?

00:10:34.720 --> 00:10:36.011
I'm here for that job.

00:10:39.470 --> 00:10:40.636
What happened, sir?

00:10:41.011 --> 00:10:42.595
Have you hired someone already?

00:10:44.011 --> 00:10:44.845
No.

00:10:45.095 --> 00:10:46.136
Then move aside.

00:10:46.761 --> 00:10:47.886
Come on, come on!

00:10:53.261 --> 00:10:55.011
You said first come, first served,

00:10:55.136 --> 00:10:56.970
so I caught the very next train
and came straight here.

00:10:57.636 --> 00:10:59.511
Looks like my trip didn't go in vain!

00:11:00.011 --> 00:11:02.761
By the way, this house is quite big!
There must be a lot of work, right?

00:11:03.136 --> 00:11:04.595
How many family members are there, sir?

00:11:06.511 --> 00:11:07.636
- Sir?
- Yes?

00:11:08.386 --> 00:11:09.636
How many family members?

00:11:11.136 --> 00:11:12.011
One.

00:11:14.011 --> 00:11:15.011
Your wife?

00:11:15.470 --> 00:11:16.136
Huh?

00:11:17.761 --> 00:11:19.511
Oh! She's gone to her parents' home.

00:11:21.595 --> 00:11:24.386
No. She hasn't yet come
from her parents' home.

00:11:24.511 --> 00:11:25.761
I'm unmarried.

00:11:27.011 --> 00:11:28.386
Are you still a bachelor, sir?

00:11:31.136 --> 00:11:33.761
I mean, are there any ladies in the house?

00:11:34.095 --> 00:11:35.094
Your mother?

00:11:35.095 --> 00:11:36.136
Sisters?

00:11:36.761 --> 00:11:37.886
They've passed away.

00:11:39.095 --> 00:11:40.719
I mean my mother passed away and sisters

00:11:40.720 --> 00:11:43.261
left to settle in their respective
in-laws' homes.

00:11:44.386 --> 00:11:46.469
If there are no women in the house, then...

00:11:46.470 --> 00:11:49.136
That's exactly what I was trying to say...

00:11:49.345 --> 00:11:52.511
I need someone full-time,
so a man would be more suitable.

00:11:53.011 --> 00:11:54.885
No, no.
I'll pay for your return fare.

00:11:54.886 --> 00:11:56.344
- Please, go back.
- No, no, sir!

00:11:56.345 --> 00:11:58.511
That's not what I meant, sir.
Where's the kitchen, sir?

00:11:59.511 --> 00:12:00.136
What?

00:12:00.261 --> 00:12:01.136
The kitchen, sir.

00:12:09.720 --> 00:12:10.720
Mr. Mintu.

00:12:11.011 --> 00:12:13.095
Didn't I tell you we needed
something truly historic?

00:12:13.386 --> 00:12:14.511
Well, here it is!

00:12:14.761 --> 00:12:16.595
My video has created a sensation.

00:12:16.845 --> 00:12:18.761
There'll be a queue of candidates now.

00:12:18.970 --> 00:12:20.511
They should be arriving any minute.

00:12:20.886 --> 00:12:22.094
They're already here.

00:12:22.095 --> 00:12:23.511
Look over there.

00:12:25.136 --> 00:12:26.470
Her name is Helen.

00:12:27.511 --> 00:12:29.011
Gorgeous!

00:12:33.095 --> 00:12:35.595
We were looking for a housekeeper,
and you've hired a secretary instead?

00:12:37.511 --> 00:12:38.719
Have you already started your services?

00:12:38.720 --> 00:12:39.510
No, no.

00:12:39.511 --> 00:12:42.345
I made the tea.
She's just straining it.

00:12:43.845 --> 00:12:45.011
She's coming.
- Yes.

00:12:46.511 --> 00:12:47.845
- Hello, sir.
- Yes, hello!

00:12:49.386 --> 00:12:50.636
Sir,

00:12:51.261 --> 00:12:53.260
you're the one who posted that video,
aren't you?

00:12:53.261 --> 00:12:54.135
Yeah, yeah.

00:12:54.136 --> 00:12:54.344
[laughs]

00:12:54.345 --> 00:12:56.136
Shall I get you some tea?

00:12:56.761 --> 00:12:58.261
Hey, no! Thank you.

00:12:59.386 --> 00:13:00.761
Myself, Rajaram Pandey.

00:13:01.261 --> 00:13:02.720
Sir, my name is Helen.

00:13:03.011 --> 00:13:03.970
- Helen!
- Yes.

00:13:04.386 --> 00:13:05.136
Beautiful name!

00:13:05.261 --> 00:13:06.094
Thank you, sir.

00:13:06.095 --> 00:13:07.511
A name like Helen,
and this line of work...

00:13:07.636 --> 00:13:08.760
- I mean...
- What do you mean, sir?

00:13:08.761 --> 00:13:09.970
I mean...

00:13:10.595 --> 00:13:11.636
how did you get into this line of work?

00:13:11.761 --> 00:13:13.470
Sir, just because my name is Helen,

00:13:13.761 --> 00:13:15.595
why can't I do this kind of work?

00:13:15.720 --> 00:13:18.136
No, I mean,

00:13:18.886 --> 00:13:20.720
you look like you come
from a respectable family.

00:13:21.261 --> 00:13:23.511
Sir, this is our family profession.

00:13:23.720 --> 00:13:25.344
We've been doing it since
my great-grandfather's time.

00:13:25.345 --> 00:13:26.845
Housekeeping and cooking.

00:13:27.011 --> 00:13:28.720
Great!

00:13:28.970 --> 00:13:30.553
- No job is big or small.
- Yes, sir.

00:13:30.761 --> 00:13:31.761
- Am I right?
- Listen.

00:13:31.886 --> 00:13:32.385
Yes?

00:13:32.386 --> 00:13:34.636
Now that you've finished
preaching your wisdom,

00:13:34.970 --> 00:13:36.885
pay her return fare and send her back.

00:13:36.886 --> 00:13:38.011
- Sir! Sir.
- Yes?

00:13:38.136 --> 00:13:39.760
- This house is quite big.
- Yeah, yeah.

00:13:39.761 --> 00:13:41.886
There's much more work
than I expected, sir.

00:13:42.261 --> 00:13:44.761
So, you'll have to reconsider
the salary a little.

00:13:45.136 --> 00:13:47.760
Your lodging and boarding
are free too, aren't they?

00:13:47.761 --> 00:13:49.761
Sir, there are no women
in the house either.

00:13:49.886 --> 00:13:52.095
In such circumstances, there's
the question of safety... just a little...

00:13:52.720 --> 00:13:53.595
- Safety?
- Yes, sir.

00:13:53.720 --> 00:13:54.595
From him?

00:13:54.761 --> 00:13:55.136
[laughs]

00:13:55.261 --> 00:13:56.386
What a joke!

00:13:56.720 --> 00:13:59.761
Mr. Dubey is as pure as snow.

00:14:01.011 --> 00:14:02.386
You could fall for him,

00:14:02.636 --> 00:14:04.136
but he'd never fall for you.

00:14:04.595 --> 00:14:05.720
That's my guarantee!

00:14:07.511 --> 00:14:08.636
- Rajaram.
- Yes?

00:14:09.386 --> 00:14:10.470
Please.

00:14:10.886 --> 00:14:12.386
Yes, excuse me.

00:14:14.636 --> 00:14:15.469
What, Pandey?

00:14:15.470 --> 00:14:17.761
Why are you talking nonsense?
Beautiful and gorgeous!

00:14:18.345 --> 00:14:19.761
You're making a fool of me!

00:14:20.136 --> 00:14:20.760
She's a woman!

00:14:20.761 --> 00:14:22.011
Where am I supposed to keep her?
How can I hire her?

00:14:22.136 --> 00:14:24.511
I have three sisters, too!
What will people say?

00:14:26.261 --> 00:14:27.761
What's wrong with you?

00:14:29.886 --> 00:14:31.136
What a beautiful girl!

00:14:31.511 --> 00:14:33.511
You don't even need to check her identity.

00:14:34.011 --> 00:14:35.595
She's clearly from a respectable family.

00:14:36.886 --> 00:14:38.761
I still can't believe your luck.

00:14:38.886 --> 00:14:40.511
It feels like I'm living in a dream.

00:14:40.761 --> 00:14:41.761
Please, slap me!

00:14:42.011 --> 00:14:42.886
No, no, no!

00:14:43.636 --> 00:14:44.761
Yeah, this is real.

00:14:46.761 --> 00:14:49.595
Come on, she's your staff,
and this is your space.

00:14:50.011 --> 00:14:51.886
She can stay anywhere, in any corner.

00:14:52.386 --> 00:14:53.386
What's the problem?

00:14:53.720 --> 00:14:54.720
Besides,

00:14:55.636 --> 00:14:57.386
when it comes to women,
you have the reputation

00:14:57.761 --> 00:14:59.011
of a gentleman.

00:15:01.011 --> 00:15:02.845
No one will have anything
to say about you!

00:15:03.011 --> 00:15:04.970
Getting my point or not?

00:15:05.345 --> 00:15:08.261
Has Mr. Dubey got a guest staying over,
Mr. Pandey?

00:15:08.386 --> 00:15:09.010
Why?

00:15:09.011 --> 00:15:12.386
When I went out to get milk this morning,
I saw a girl walking away with a bag.

00:15:12.511 --> 00:15:13.011
You saw her?

00:15:13.136 --> 00:15:15.845
Yes. At first,
I thought a cousin has come to visit.

00:15:16.761 --> 00:15:17.886
She's not a cousin.

00:15:18.720 --> 00:15:19.595
She's a housekeeper.

00:15:19.720 --> 00:15:20.386
A maid?

00:15:20.761 --> 00:15:21.385
A maid?!

00:15:21.386 --> 00:15:23.261
Maids are what people like you
and me have!

00:15:23.595 --> 00:15:24.386
Understand?

00:15:24.595 --> 00:15:25.595
Don't call her just anything.

00:15:26.095 --> 00:15:27.095
She's a full-time staff member!

00:15:27.345 --> 00:15:28.386
Full-time means what?

00:15:29.261 --> 00:15:30.386
She'll be there all day?

00:15:30.511 --> 00:15:31.385
She'll be there all night, too.

00:15:31.386 --> 00:15:32.470
What?!

00:15:32.970 --> 00:15:33.761
All night?

00:15:33.886 --> 00:15:35.261
I reacted the same way!

00:15:35.761 --> 00:15:37.260
Mr. Dubey said
why I am reacting like that?

00:15:37.261 --> 00:15:38.345
I asked him, "What will people say?"

00:15:38.595 --> 00:15:39.553
And he said, "What will they say?

00:15:39.720 --> 00:15:42.386
She's my staff, and this is my space.
She can stay wherever she likes.

00:15:43.386 --> 00:15:44.761
Why care about people? My foot!"

00:15:46.261 --> 00:15:47.136
I kept quiet.

00:15:47.261 --> 00:15:48.136
What else could I say?

00:15:51.845 --> 00:15:52.719
Do you know her name?

00:15:52.720 --> 00:15:53.761
- What?
- What?

00:15:55.511 --> 00:15:56.386
Helen.

00:15:56.595 --> 00:15:57.510
Helen?!

00:15:57.511 --> 00:15:58.845
Helen!

00:15:59.261 --> 00:16:01.511
Now, that's a top-class name!
Sounds just like a heroine.

00:16:01.720 --> 00:16:03.761
You bet! I saw her myself this morning.

00:16:04.011 --> 00:16:06.635
She must be a real firecracker,
Mr. Pandey.

00:16:06.636 --> 00:16:07.720
Huh?

00:16:08.720 --> 00:16:10.261
You fool! Not just a firecracker,

00:16:11.386 --> 00:16:12.470
she's an atom bomb!

00:16:12.595 --> 00:16:13.761
An atom bomb?!

00:16:14.345 --> 00:16:16.095
Absolutely, sir.
An atom bomb!

00:16:17.261 --> 00:16:19.136
Tell everybody to follow my page. - Okay.

00:16:19.261 --> 00:16:20.595
- I hope I haven't missed the bus today.
- No.

00:16:20.720 --> 00:16:23.511
I got late while making morning videos.

00:16:23.720 --> 00:16:24.761
What did you make today?

00:16:25.261 --> 00:16:26.261
Forget that.

00:16:26.886 --> 00:16:28.010
Want some fresh news?

00:16:28.011 --> 00:16:29.261
Yes, tell us!

00:16:29.470 --> 00:16:30.761
You know Mr. Dubey? - Yes.

00:16:30.886 --> 00:16:34.635
He has found himself
a full-time housekeeper!

00:16:34.636 --> 00:16:35.595
- Who?
- Really?

00:16:35.761 --> 00:16:36.760
Helen!

00:16:36.761 --> 00:16:38.720
Mr. Pandey just told us about her. - Okay.

00:16:39.011 --> 00:16:40.386
What exactly this full-time means?

00:16:40.886 --> 00:16:42.261
She'll live right there in the house.

00:16:42.386 --> 00:16:45.511
Day and night.

00:16:45.761 --> 00:16:46.845
What are you saying?

00:16:48.095 --> 00:16:49.720
Now that's some juicy news.

00:16:49.886 --> 00:16:50.469
[laughter]

00:16:50.470 --> 00:16:53.261
I'd never keep a woman like that
in my house, no way.

00:16:53.720 --> 00:16:56.011
After all, who would keep a lit lamp
next to a block of camphor?

00:16:56.136 --> 00:16:57.011
[laughter]

00:16:57.636 --> 00:16:58.553
Let me tell you something. - Yes.

00:16:58.720 --> 00:17:00.761
If she's going to be around him
day and night,

00:17:00.886 --> 00:17:02.095
let alone the camphor,

00:17:02.345 --> 00:17:05.720
even a damp piece of wood like
brother Ranjan will catch fire.

00:17:05.886 --> 00:17:07.761
He'll be blazing away in no time.

00:17:07.886 --> 00:17:08.761
[laughter]

00:17:09.720 --> 00:17:10.719
<i>[Narrator] Like that,</i>

00:17:10.720 --> 00:17:13.385
<i>before the houses in the neighbourhood
could prepare office lunchboxes,</i>

00:17:13.386 --> 00:17:14.636
<i>Mr. Dubey and Helen</i>

00:17:14.761 --> 00:17:17.678
<i>had become the hottest topic of discussion
in the entire neighbourhood.</i>

00:17:46.386 --> 00:17:48.470
Oh... there's no pocket?

00:17:58.761 --> 00:18:02.886
Sir, sorry.
I wanted to ask. Do you eat non-veg, sir?

00:18:04.511 --> 00:18:07.720
Shall I make black pepper chicken
for dinner?

00:18:10.511 --> 00:18:11.886
I'm an eggetarian. - Huh?

00:18:14.720 --> 00:18:15.886
An eggetarian.

00:18:17.136 --> 00:18:20.011
But there are no eggs in the house.

00:18:21.761 --> 00:18:24.845
I'll buy all the kitchen essentials
this afternoon.

00:18:28.470 --> 00:18:29.345
Alright.

00:18:34.636 --> 00:18:37.511
Um... could you give me some money
for the groceries, sir?

00:18:38.386 --> 00:18:39.595
Oh, yes!

00:18:46.136 --> 00:18:47.136
Here you go.

00:18:47.470 --> 00:18:48.511
Thank you.

00:18:52.761 --> 00:18:57.261
Actually, apart from an old fridge
and a TV,

00:18:57.761 --> 00:19:00.720
there's nothing in this house
worth stealing.

00:19:01.886 --> 00:19:02.761
What?

00:19:03.011 --> 00:19:04.886
No, I mean... still,

00:19:06.261 --> 00:19:10.761
please lock the door

00:19:12.261 --> 00:19:15.386
and give it a good tug
to make sure it's locked.

00:19:17.136 --> 00:19:18.761
And what about your key, sir?

00:19:18.886 --> 00:19:20.761
I have another key.

00:19:20.886 --> 00:19:22.761
A duplicate one... at the office.

00:19:31.470 --> 00:19:32.470
Yes, sir.

00:19:38.720 --> 00:19:39.720
Sir.

00:19:44.636 --> 00:19:45.886
Thank you.

00:19:52.053 --> 00:19:53.761
[doorbell rings]

00:19:55.636 --> 00:19:59.095
Guys, we're going live!
Move aside, don't ruin the shot!

00:20:01.511 --> 00:20:02.469
Hi, guys!

00:20:02.470 --> 00:20:05.385
Welcome to Tamanna Pandey's making blog!

00:20:05.386 --> 00:20:09.385
Today, I'm going to introduce you
to someone special.

00:20:09.386 --> 00:20:12.886
She'll be looking after
Mr. Ranjan's house.

00:20:13.011 --> 00:20:14.345
What's her name?

00:20:14.761 --> 00:20:16.011
Any guesses?

00:20:16.136 --> 00:20:17.886
Anita! Vinita! Sunita!

00:20:18.345 --> 00:20:19.344
Nope!

00:20:19.345 --> 00:20:21.636
Her name is Helen!

00:20:21.761 --> 00:20:23.969
Come on! Come, come!
Get properly into my video!

00:20:23.970 --> 00:20:28.886
She's the one who'll make
this entire house sparkle!

00:20:29.511 --> 00:20:31.511
So, guys, I'll take your leave now.

00:20:31.636 --> 00:20:34.344
Follow, share, and hit the bell button!

00:20:34.345 --> 00:20:37.886
And please sub... scrib... sub...

00:20:38.761 --> 00:20:40.095
Subscribe!

00:20:40.970 --> 00:20:42.386
The video already ended by then!

00:20:43.595 --> 00:20:47.010
I have 19 sub... scrib...

00:20:47.011 --> 00:20:48.260
Subscribers!

00:20:48.261 --> 00:20:50.510
There you go! Nineteen!

00:20:50.511 --> 00:20:52.595
- Nineteen?
- Nineteen!

00:20:52.761 --> 00:20:53.970
Wow!

00:20:55.761 --> 00:20:56.720
Not bad!

00:20:56.886 --> 00:20:57.845
[laughs]

00:20:58.261 --> 00:21:00.011
I completely forgot to introduce myself!

00:21:00.470 --> 00:21:03.845
I'm Mr. Pandey's religious wife,
Tamanna Pandey.

00:21:05.761 --> 00:21:07.386
Religious wife?

00:21:08.386 --> 00:21:09.761
His lawful wife!

00:21:10.720 --> 00:21:13.386
Name is Helen, but your English is weak.

00:21:13.761 --> 00:21:15.261
I'll help you improve it!

00:21:20.136 --> 00:21:21.386
Did you make tea?

00:21:22.761 --> 00:21:24.761
Yes. I made some this morning.

00:21:25.136 --> 00:21:26.136
Shall I make you some?

00:21:26.345 --> 00:21:27.470
No, no!

00:21:31.720 --> 00:21:32.553
Go ahead and make it!

00:21:32.720 --> 00:21:33.720
[laughs]

00:21:34.845 --> 00:21:35.761
Make some!

00:21:36.595 --> 00:21:37.469
And bring biscuits, too.

00:21:37.470 --> 00:21:38.595
Alright!

00:21:40.470 --> 00:21:42.720
My god! She's so beautiful!

00:21:54.886 --> 00:21:55.970
Here's your tiffin!

00:21:56.470 --> 00:21:57.636
From your house.

00:21:58.011 --> 00:21:59.011
From my house?

00:21:59.845 --> 00:22:00.886
Did my sister bring it?

00:22:01.136 --> 00:22:02.011
Sister?!

00:22:02.511 --> 00:22:03.720
She said sir to you!

00:22:04.136 --> 00:22:05.136
She's standing outside!

00:22:05.720 --> 00:22:06.511
Really?

00:22:08.845 --> 00:22:09.761
Sir.

00:22:15.136 --> 00:22:16.470
You're here?

00:22:16.845 --> 00:22:19.386
Sir, did you get your tiffin?

00:22:19.595 --> 00:22:20.970
There you go, she called you sir!

00:22:24.511 --> 00:22:26.511
Why did you come here?

00:22:26.720 --> 00:22:28.636
I mean, how did you find this address?

00:22:29.136 --> 00:22:33.011
Sir, sister-in-law Tamanna came
to the house to make a reel.

00:22:33.511 --> 00:22:34.470
She told me.

00:22:35.011 --> 00:22:38.595
And sir, I've brought all the vegetables
and groceries for the house,

00:22:38.720 --> 00:22:41.386
so I thought I'd prepare your lunch
and bring it over.

00:22:41.845 --> 00:22:43.261
You've gone a little too far
with your thinking.

00:22:45.761 --> 00:22:48.011
Sir, now that I know where you work,

00:22:48.136 --> 00:22:51.511
I can bring your lunch over
here regularly, right on time.

00:22:54.761 --> 00:22:56.094
No, there's no need.

00:22:56.095 --> 00:22:57.761
There's a cafeteria here.

00:22:57.886 --> 00:22:59.510
You get good food there.

00:22:59.511 --> 00:23:01.761
Yes, yes! Of course!
It's right across the road.

00:23:02.261 --> 00:23:05.886
Sir, I could also prepare your lunch
along with breakfast.

00:23:06.261 --> 00:23:08.595
Then you could bring it yourself
in the morning.

00:23:08.761 --> 00:23:12.260
No, we'll discuss that at home.

00:23:12.261 --> 00:23:15.594
For now, take the money
and go home by an auto.

00:23:15.595 --> 00:23:16.761
No, no, sir.

00:23:17.011 --> 00:23:19.386
You gave me money this morning,
and I still have it.

00:23:19.511 --> 00:23:21.470
So I'll take the metro, sir.

00:23:22.511 --> 00:23:23.845
Alright.

00:23:25.136 --> 00:23:25.970
Sir.

00:23:28.845 --> 00:23:29.845
Sir.

00:23:30.886 --> 00:23:32.720
I wanted to talk to you.

00:23:34.886 --> 00:23:35.886
Yes, sir.

00:23:43.386 --> 00:23:45.386
You can tell me from there.
What is it?

00:23:52.761 --> 00:23:54.511
Sir, I forgot the house keys.

00:23:55.261 --> 00:23:56.094
Oh!

00:23:56.095 --> 00:23:58.345
There's a duplicate key
at the office, right, sir?

00:23:59.761 --> 00:24:00.636
Yes!

00:24:04.845 --> 00:24:06.511
Or I can wait outside.

00:24:06.636 --> 00:24:08.470
Once you finish your work,

00:24:08.720 --> 00:24:10.470
I can leave with you, sir.

00:24:10.720 --> 00:24:12.885
No, no, don't wait outside.

00:24:12.886 --> 00:24:14.511
No, actually, please do wait outside!

00:24:14.761 --> 00:24:18.386
I'll send this gentleman
to get the duplicate key for you.

00:24:18.511 --> 00:24:19.136
Alright?

00:24:19.386 --> 00:24:19.885
Thank you, sir.

00:24:19.886 --> 00:24:20.720
Come on.

00:24:25.970 --> 00:24:26.761
Yes, sir.

00:24:29.345 --> 00:24:30.011
Yes, sir.

00:24:34.095 --> 00:24:34.885
For the first time,

00:24:34.886 --> 00:24:37.386
the electricity department office was
glowing with a different kind of light.

00:24:39.261 --> 00:24:40.470
Look at him, buddy!

00:24:40.761 --> 00:24:42.511
Dubey is blushing pink with love!

00:24:42.636 --> 00:24:43.511
[laughter]

00:24:44.511 --> 00:24:46.470
Listen, everyone!
Please, please, please!

00:24:46.636 --> 00:24:49.636
She is not my girlfriend!
She's just the housekeeper and cook.

00:24:49.761 --> 00:24:50.511
- That's all.
- Really?

00:24:50.636 --> 00:24:51.595
What is he saying?

00:24:51.761 --> 00:24:53.261
- That's right.
- Yes.

00:24:53.511 --> 00:24:55.761
At this age, how long are you going
to keep lying for your friend, Mr. Pandey?

00:24:55.886 --> 00:24:56.969
What... what do you mean?

00:24:56.970 --> 00:24:59.510
Come on! Have you ever seen
a housekeeper this beautiful?

00:24:59.511 --> 00:25:00.595
- But she is a housekeeper, right?
- Right?

00:25:00.720 --> 00:25:02.136
- And she's so cultured too!
- Absolutely, brother!

00:25:02.261 --> 00:25:04.260
This is definitely just an excuse
to keep his girlfriend around!

00:25:04.261 --> 00:25:05.552
Yes, brother.
You're absolutely right.

00:25:05.553 --> 00:25:07.095
Wait a second!

00:25:07.761 --> 00:25:08.553
What have you got in your lunchbox?

00:25:08.761 --> 00:25:09.469
Hotchpotch.

00:25:09.470 --> 00:25:10.261
And yours?

00:25:10.386 --> 00:25:11.011
Potatoes, sir.

00:25:11.470 --> 00:25:12.094
And yours?

00:25:12.095 --> 00:25:13.344
The same old hotchpotch every day.

00:25:13.345 --> 00:25:14.136
The same old hotchpotch!

00:25:14.261 --> 00:25:16.760
Bottle gourd in one, ridge gourd
in another, and pumpkin in his lunch! Huh?

00:25:16.761 --> 00:25:18.136
- Now, look at what we have here, gentlemen!
- What?

00:25:18.261 --> 00:25:21.511
Look at this!
Spicy lentil seasoned in pure ghee.

00:25:21.720 --> 00:25:22.595
And look at this.

00:25:22.720 --> 00:25:23.386
Stuffed eggplant dish!

00:25:23.511 --> 00:25:24.886
Hey, bring that dish over here,
Mr. Pandey!

00:25:25.011 --> 00:25:26.344
And here's a green salad.

00:25:26.345 --> 00:25:27.344
Ah... bring it here!

00:25:27.345 --> 00:25:28.469
Taste it! Taste it!

00:25:28.470 --> 00:25:29.470
[laughs]

00:25:29.761 --> 00:25:30.720
Taste it! Taste it!

00:25:31.845 --> 00:25:32.886
Excellent!

00:25:33.345 --> 00:25:34.636
You also have some!
You also have some!

00:25:34.886 --> 00:25:37.385
Oh, wow! Just amazing!

00:25:37.386 --> 00:25:38.510
Here, have some.
Go on.

00:25:38.511 --> 00:25:39.885
Absolutely top-notch, sir!

00:25:39.886 --> 00:25:41.136
The stuffed eggplant is outstanding!

00:25:41.261 --> 00:25:42.720
Now, tell me something, gentlemen.

00:25:42.886 --> 00:25:44.844
Does any wife or girlfriend
cook food this delicious?

00:25:44.845 --> 00:25:46.386
- No... no, absolutely not!
- This is a professional's job.

00:25:58.386 --> 00:26:00.261
Sir.
Sir, welcome home.

00:26:02.636 --> 00:26:03.719
Sir, give it to me.
I'll take it.

00:26:03.720 --> 00:26:04.761
Yes.

00:26:06.136 --> 00:26:07.386
So many okras?

00:26:08.345 --> 00:26:09.761
Well,

00:26:10.970 --> 00:26:13.886
the office staff requested stuffed
okra tomorrow!

00:26:14.261 --> 00:26:16.011
Everyone loved your eggplant dish.

00:26:16.386 --> 00:26:19.095
No, they loved the eggplant dish.

00:26:20.470 --> 00:26:21.636
You liked it too, sir?

00:26:22.011 --> 00:26:23.095
Yes, it was good.

00:26:23.761 --> 00:26:25.886
But where did I get any?
I only managed a little taste.

00:26:28.886 --> 00:26:30.136
- Sir.
- Yes?

00:26:30.470 --> 00:26:31.761
I'm sorry, sir.

00:26:32.345 --> 00:26:34.261
I came without informing you.

00:26:35.136 --> 00:26:36.261
Yes.

00:26:37.261 --> 00:26:40.719
Next time, please call before coming.

00:26:40.720 --> 00:26:42.344
And if possible,

00:26:42.345 --> 00:26:44.761
stay a hundred or two hundred
metres away from the office!

00:26:45.011 --> 00:26:45.761
Yes, sir.

00:26:46.011 --> 00:26:48.969
Please wash your hands and freshen up.
I'll prepare your evening tea.

00:26:48.970 --> 00:26:50.136
Yes.

00:26:51.845 --> 00:26:53.595
Evening tea?!

00:26:58.761 --> 00:27:02.595
Has this fountain started working again?

00:27:03.470 --> 00:27:05.885
Sir, there was mud clogging the pipe.

00:27:05.886 --> 00:27:07.136
I cleaned it.

00:27:08.845 --> 00:27:11.595
And what about all that junk lying
around from the neighbourhood?

00:27:12.345 --> 00:27:14.511
Sir, that was easy.
I moved it to the backyard.

00:27:23.595 --> 00:27:26.886
Sir, egg pepper fry.

00:27:30.595 --> 00:27:31.636
Shall I serve it, sir?

00:27:31.761 --> 00:27:32.970
No, no, I'll...

00:27:37.261 --> 00:27:38.761
I'll bring you hot flatbreads, sir.

00:27:41.428 --> 00:27:43.303
[upbeat music]

00:28:00.261 --> 00:28:01.470
Sir.

00:28:02.095 --> 00:28:03.720
Breakfast is ready, sir.

00:28:08.511 --> 00:28:11.595
<i>♪ The moon looks beautiful. ♪</i>

00:28:11.761 --> 00:28:12.886
Sir.

00:28:14.595 --> 00:28:17.761
<i>♪ I don't like to do anything. ♪</i>

00:28:19.720 --> 00:28:23.511
<i>♪ The moon looks beautiful. ♪</i>

00:28:23.886 --> 00:28:26.720
<i>♪ I don't like to do anything. ♪</i>

00:28:26.886 --> 00:28:31.595
<i>♪ If someone asks me, I say all is well. ♪</i>

00:28:31.761 --> 00:28:34.636
<i>♪ The jingle bell is ringing in my heart. ♪</i>

00:28:34.761 --> 00:28:40.470
<i>♪ The jingle bell is ringing in my heart. ♪</i>

00:28:40.720 --> 00:28:47.511
<i>♪ Jingle bell. Jingle bell. ♪</i>

00:28:50.261 --> 00:28:51.886
Brother, you seem
to be looking rather

00:28:52.011 --> 00:28:53.261
dishevelled these days.

00:28:53.511 --> 00:28:54.136
Dishevelled?

00:28:54.261 --> 00:28:56.261
I mean, changed!
You seem different.

00:28:56.595 --> 00:28:57.470
Look at you!

00:28:57.720 --> 00:29:00.885
Sometimes blue, sometimes yellow,
sometimes pink.

00:29:00.886 --> 00:29:02.845
Where are all these colourful
clothes coming from?

00:29:03.011 --> 00:29:05.595
Well, Mr. Pandey,
I always had these clothes,

00:29:06.261 --> 00:29:07.470
but never noticed them.

00:29:07.886 --> 00:29:09.595
Ever since Helen arrived,

00:29:10.261 --> 00:29:12.595
I'm healthy on the inside
and handsome on the outside.

00:29:13.345 --> 00:29:14.261
Thanks to you!

00:29:14.386 --> 00:29:15.261
Oh, no!

00:29:15.386 --> 00:29:17.261
[laughter]

00:29:21.511 --> 00:29:22.511
Take it.

00:29:23.761 --> 00:29:24.719
Oh, no!

00:29:24.720 --> 00:29:25.636
[laughter]

00:29:25.761 --> 00:29:26.761
Be careful!

00:29:27.136 --> 00:29:28.011
For the past week,

00:29:28.136 --> 00:29:30.095
this whole team of uncles
has been showing up every day

00:29:30.345 --> 00:29:31.761
at this very hour,
they surround the courtyard.

00:29:32.595 --> 00:29:33.470
What's going on?

00:29:34.511 --> 00:29:35.261
Look over there.

00:29:35.761 --> 00:29:36.761
There's your answer!

00:29:48.095 --> 00:29:48.928
Break time!

00:29:49.095 --> 00:29:49.303
[upbeat music]

00:29:49.428 --> 00:29:50.595
Helen is here!

00:30:00.845 --> 00:30:01.845
Glucose!

00:30:03.386 --> 00:30:04.636
Helen! Helen!

00:30:04.761 --> 00:30:06.260
- Yes, sir?
- Listen, listen.

00:30:06.261 --> 00:30:08.261
Just... just this much.

00:30:08.386 --> 00:30:09.511
Manage the rest.

00:30:09.970 --> 00:30:12.095
Sir, I just have to
put it into the machine.

00:30:12.761 --> 00:30:13.761
No,

00:30:14.511 --> 00:30:16.511
this is personal... I'll do it myself!
I'll do it.

00:30:16.761 --> 00:30:17.761
You manage the rest.

00:30:30.595 --> 00:30:31.761
Oh, Uncle!

00:30:32.761 --> 00:30:34.760
I'd only come to get the network fixed.

00:30:34.761 --> 00:30:36.136
It's working now, so I'm leaving.

00:30:36.261 --> 00:30:37.469
At the age when you should
be getting cataracts,

00:30:37.470 --> 00:30:39.011
you're getting attracted instead!

00:30:40.886 --> 00:30:43.761
And what about you, gentlemen?

00:30:43.886 --> 00:30:45.636
We were just getting some vitamin D.

00:30:45.761 --> 00:30:47.886
Careful! Too much of it,
and you'll dry up!

00:30:48.261 --> 00:30:50.136
No, no, we're leaving.

00:30:53.636 --> 00:30:54.720
Run! Run!

00:30:56.845 --> 00:30:58.095
Helen.

00:30:59.761 --> 00:31:01.886
- Yes?
- Your followers just keep increasing.

00:31:02.136 --> 00:31:03.511
Leave it, sir.

00:31:05.470 --> 00:31:08.845
<i>♪ Come without hesitation... ♪</i>

00:31:10.636 --> 00:31:14.636
<i>♪ Filling all the emptiness... ♪</i>

00:31:14.845 --> 00:31:17.011
<i>♪ Of life's canvas. ♪</i>

00:31:17.220 --> 00:31:18.636
Good morning, sir.

00:31:19.011 --> 00:31:20.886
Today, you look as handsome as a hero.

00:31:22.761 --> 00:31:25.636
<i>♪ The jingle bell is ringing in my heart. ♪</i>

00:31:25.761 --> 00:31:28.511
<i>♪ The jingle bell is ringing in my heart. ♪</i>

00:31:28.720 --> 00:31:31.511
<i>♪ The jingle bell is ringing in my heart. ♪</i>

00:31:31.761 --> 00:31:38.136
<i>♪ The jingle bell is ringing in my heart. ♪</i>

00:31:45.136 --> 00:31:47.136
[upbeat music]

00:32:54.095 --> 00:32:58.095
[intriguing music]

00:33:13.720 --> 00:33:15.636
Please be seated, Mr. Dubey. How are you?

00:33:15.886 --> 00:33:17.095
Sir. Sir.

00:33:17.470 --> 00:33:19.886
You're doing an injustice, Mr. Dubey.

00:33:20.136 --> 00:33:20.886
What happened, sir?

00:33:21.011 --> 00:33:23.136
You've doing catering in the office.

00:33:23.470 --> 00:33:24.760
But you didn't call me.

00:33:24.761 --> 00:33:25.720
[laughs]

00:33:25.970 --> 00:33:29.345
Sir, I just got tiffin
from home for a couple of days.

00:33:29.511 --> 00:33:31.761
Everyone's talking about that tiffin.

00:33:32.136 --> 00:33:34.011
The canteen guy was complaining

00:33:34.386 --> 00:33:36.511
that Mr. Dubey ruined my business.

00:33:36.761 --> 00:33:38.511
Sir, if you say,
I'll stop bringing it from tomorrow.

00:33:38.636 --> 00:33:39.886
No, no, don't.

00:33:40.011 --> 00:33:41.261
To hell with that guy!

00:33:41.386 --> 00:33:43.094
The idiot adds soda to the food.

00:33:43.095 --> 00:33:44.761
It gives me gas every time.

00:33:45.095 --> 00:33:46.095
Sir. Sir.

00:33:47.261 --> 00:33:48.886
By the way, I hope you remember

00:33:49.886 --> 00:33:51.636
this Saturday is my birthday.

00:33:51.761 --> 00:33:54.553
- Happy birthday!
- Sir! Sir!

00:33:54.720 --> 00:33:58.470
So, I was thinking of having the party
at your house.

00:33:59.386 --> 00:34:00.386
But one thing.

00:34:00.511 --> 00:34:04.261
I'll bring the supplies,
and you'll arrange the cooking.

00:34:04.386 --> 00:34:06.385
- Yes, yes... of course!
- It'll be a family gathering.

00:34:06.386 --> 00:34:09.136
And Saturday evening
will be one to remember.

00:34:09.261 --> 00:34:10.136
Sir! Sir!

00:34:10.261 --> 00:34:14.136
<i>♪ Sir, sir, sir. ♪</i>

00:34:14.261 --> 00:34:17.511
<i>♪ Sir, sir, sir. ♪</i>

00:34:17.720 --> 00:34:20.510
I declare the party is open.

00:34:20.511 --> 00:34:24.886
<i>♪ I'll say, "Sir, sir, sir,"
just like you say. ♪</i>

00:34:28.136 --> 00:34:32.636
<i>♪ I'll say, "Sir, sir, sir,"
just like you say. ♪</i>

00:34:37.136 --> 00:34:40.386
<i>♪ My heart is dancing. ♪</i>

00:34:40.970 --> 00:34:43.011
Wow, Helen!

00:34:43.345 --> 00:34:45.095
You've really spruced up the house.

00:34:45.636 --> 00:34:47.011
Maid in heaven!

00:34:47.511 --> 00:34:48.970
Is it ready? Give me.

00:34:49.970 --> 00:34:50.886
Give it!

00:34:51.761 --> 00:34:53.136
Keep working this diligently,

00:34:53.261 --> 00:34:54.595
and I'll recommend you
to a few more households.

00:34:54.720 --> 00:34:55.885
Give me more.

00:34:55.886 --> 00:34:57.511
We're partying!

00:34:58.136 --> 00:35:02.595
<i>♪ I'll say, "Sir, sir, sir,"
just like you say. ♪</i>

00:35:05.761 --> 00:35:10.095
<i>♪ I'll say, "Sir, sir, sir,"
just like you say. ♪</i>

00:35:22.720 --> 00:35:24.011
What's got your attention, brother?

00:35:24.261 --> 00:35:27.386
I'm just thinking about the difficulties
working women face.

00:35:27.511 --> 00:35:31.011
In place of Helen,
if there were my mother, sister, or wife,

00:35:31.136 --> 00:35:33.094
would anyone dare
to go near her like that?

00:35:33.095 --> 00:35:35.845
Oh, come on! You're jealous.

00:35:36.261 --> 00:35:37.136
Really?

00:35:37.261 --> 00:35:39.761
Because the party is from your pocket,

00:35:40.720 --> 00:35:42.261
but she's getting all the credit.

00:35:42.511 --> 00:35:43.595
What?

00:35:48.720 --> 00:35:51.636
Oh, Ghanu! You're here?

00:35:51.761 --> 00:35:54.136
No, the poor woman has been working
alone since morning.

00:35:54.261 --> 00:35:55.510
I couldn't just sit and watch,

00:35:55.511 --> 00:35:56.969
so I thought I'd lend her a hand.

00:35:56.970 --> 00:35:58.385
But why did you come here?

00:35:58.386 --> 00:35:59.761
To join the party or to cook?

00:36:00.095 --> 00:36:01.510
We're here for the party, too.

00:36:01.511 --> 00:36:03.470
Yes. Your wife is waiting over there.

00:36:03.720 --> 00:36:04.761
- Has she come here?
- Yes.

00:36:05.011 --> 00:36:07.095
Oh, yes. She's here.
Just a minute.

00:36:08.761 --> 00:36:10.094
Hey, Mr. Khanna!

00:36:10.095 --> 00:36:12.260
What are you doing behind the fridge?

00:36:12.261 --> 00:36:14.011
Nothing... I was just...

00:36:14.761 --> 00:36:16.510
I'm a bit of a cleanliness freak.

00:36:16.511 --> 00:36:18.344
Mr. Khanna was saying that
[laughs]

00:36:18.345 --> 00:36:20.886
if I want a change,
I should let him know!

00:36:21.720 --> 00:36:23.719
He could find the source
of extra income for me.

00:36:23.720 --> 00:36:25.844
His relative owns a three-star hotel.

00:36:25.845 --> 00:36:27.844
He could get me a chef's job there.
Isn't that right, Mr. Khanna?

00:36:27.845 --> 00:36:30.719
I was only joking.

00:36:30.720 --> 00:36:31.470
Yes.

00:36:31.886 --> 00:36:34.136
I need to make a drink for Mr. Gupta.

00:36:34.261 --> 00:36:35.344
- Right!
- I'll see you soon.

00:36:35.345 --> 00:36:36.886
- Excuse me, please.
- Sure.

00:36:37.095 --> 00:36:39.470
- He's caught.
- Hey, Mr. Siddiqui! You!

00:36:40.595 --> 00:36:42.761
Yes, I'm just leaving.

00:36:42.886 --> 00:36:45.136
- This way.
- Yes, of course.

00:36:47.761 --> 00:36:50.345
If you need any help, let me know.

00:36:50.720 --> 00:36:51.760
Don't worry, sir.

00:36:51.761 --> 00:36:53.136
I'll handle it.

00:36:53.261 --> 00:36:54.636
That's great.

00:36:57.011 --> 00:36:58.761
- Nice arrangements.
- Please, have a seat, sir.

00:36:58.886 --> 00:37:00.595
- Okay.
- Hello, I'm Swati!

00:37:00.761 --> 00:37:03.136
Accounts department, third floor.

00:37:04.636 --> 00:37:05.760
Hello, Ms. Swati.

00:37:05.761 --> 00:37:06.845
[laughs] Yes, hello.

00:37:07.761 --> 00:37:09.095
You have a lovely place here.

00:37:09.261 --> 00:37:10.094
Yes.

00:37:10.095 --> 00:37:11.470
It looks quite spacious.

00:37:12.636 --> 00:37:14.136
I've seen the ground floor.

00:37:14.386 --> 00:37:15.636
How about giving me a tour?

00:37:15.886 --> 00:37:17.886
Yes, sure.
Come, the stairs are this way.

00:37:18.095 --> 00:37:19.511
I'll show you around.

00:37:19.720 --> 00:37:20.595
Come.

00:37:29.136 --> 00:37:32.095
You've had a lot of extra work today.

00:37:32.720 --> 00:37:34.970
I'll pay you a little extra next month.

00:37:35.761 --> 00:37:36.845
Thank you, sir.

00:37:39.720 --> 00:37:40.345
Sir.

00:37:40.595 --> 00:37:41.511
Hmm?

00:37:42.011 --> 00:37:44.010
You should get married now.

00:37:44.011 --> 00:37:47.011
[chuckles]

00:37:47.761 --> 00:37:49.511
I'll get married when I find someone.

00:37:49.970 --> 00:37:54.636
Sir, please don't even consider marrying
the lady who came today.

00:37:55.261 --> 00:37:56.844
The one who wanted a tour of the house?

00:37:56.845 --> 00:37:57.761
Yes.

00:37:58.595 --> 00:37:59.636
She's too high-class.

00:37:59.761 --> 00:38:01.386
She wouldn't even give me a second look.

00:38:01.511 --> 00:38:03.761
She's actually taken with your property.

00:38:03.970 --> 00:38:04.636
Really?

00:38:04.761 --> 00:38:05.719
Yes.

00:38:05.720 --> 00:38:07.720
[chuckles]

00:38:09.720 --> 00:38:11.261
By the way, why haven't you married yet?

00:38:14.095 --> 00:38:15.470
Haven't you found anyone?

00:38:15.761 --> 00:38:18.761
Sir, I get proposals every day.

00:38:19.386 --> 00:38:21.386
But I don't want to get married.

00:38:22.386 --> 00:38:25.261
There's still so much
I want to do in life,

00:38:26.011 --> 00:38:27.260
so much more to explore.

00:38:27.261 --> 00:38:28.510
No, I can understand.

00:38:28.511 --> 00:38:31.136
After marriage,
girls have to give up playing,

00:38:31.261 --> 00:38:33.595
having fun, flying, swimming, everything.

00:38:33.720 --> 00:38:35.136
- Exactly!
- Speaking of flying,

00:38:35.761 --> 00:38:38.844
when you go to the terrace to dry clothes,
don't take off from there directly!

00:38:38.845 --> 00:38:40.844
[laughter]

00:38:40.845 --> 00:38:42.845
[sneezes]

00:38:44.011 --> 00:38:45.011
What happened?

00:38:45.136 --> 00:38:47.011
[coughs]

00:38:47.136 --> 00:38:48.260
Have you caught a cold?

00:38:48.261 --> 00:38:49.636
No, sir.

00:38:50.011 --> 00:38:51.469
I haven't even had anything cold to drink.

00:38:51.470 --> 00:38:52.636
I don't know what happened.

00:38:52.886 --> 00:38:54.886
[sneezes]

00:38:56.345 --> 00:38:58.886
Come here, let me see.

00:38:59.345 --> 00:39:00.720
- Here you go, sir.
- No.

00:39:02.970 --> 00:39:04.386
Oh... sorry.

00:39:05.720 --> 00:39:06.970
- May I?
- Yes, sir.

00:39:08.261 --> 00:39:09.386
Oh,

00:39:09.970 --> 00:39:12.720
you have a fever!

00:39:13.511 --> 00:39:14.761
Do one thing.
Leave this work.

00:39:14.886 --> 00:39:17.761
Let me get the first-aid box.
I have a thermometer in it.

00:39:25.011 --> 00:39:26.845
You have a temperature of 100 degrees.

00:39:29.011 --> 00:39:30.886
You... get some rest.

00:39:31.261 --> 00:39:33.845
Sir, there are dirty dishes in the kitchen.
They'll start smelling by morning.

00:39:33.970 --> 00:39:35.386
Don't worry.
I'll take care of it.

00:39:35.511 --> 00:39:37.511
Your health comes first, so just rest.

00:39:38.011 --> 00:39:40.761
Have you eaten anything,
or have you been working all day?

00:39:41.136 --> 00:39:42.636
I had a few French fries, sir.

00:39:42.761 --> 00:39:44.761
Very good! Those are so nutritious!

00:39:46.595 --> 00:39:48.719
Here, take this medicine.

00:39:48.720 --> 00:39:50.386
I'll bring you something to eat.

00:39:50.511 --> 00:39:51.677
Have your food, take the medicine,
and go to sleep.

00:39:51.678 --> 00:39:54.011
You'll be fine by tomorrow.

00:39:55.011 --> 00:39:56.136
- Yes, sir.
- Yes.

00:39:56.470 --> 00:39:58.761
Please take care of your own health, too.

00:39:59.845 --> 00:40:00.761
Thank you, sir.

00:40:00.886 --> 00:40:01.720
Okay.

00:40:08.470 --> 00:40:09.761
It's 'Raksha Bandhan' today.

00:40:09.970 --> 00:40:12.511
All the sisters will get cash.

00:40:13.636 --> 00:40:14.970
Be careful, Lucky.

00:40:15.261 --> 00:40:16.136
Hello!

00:40:16.261 --> 00:40:18.345
I'm Harishankar.

00:40:18.511 --> 00:40:19.886
- Hello!
- The eldest son-in-law.

00:40:20.720 --> 00:40:21.510
Hello!

00:40:21.511 --> 00:40:22.969
You got the fountain repaired.

00:40:22.970 --> 00:40:23.760
Yes, sister.

00:40:23.761 --> 00:40:24.510
That's great!

00:40:24.511 --> 00:40:25.511
- Please, have some.
- Yes.

00:40:25.761 --> 00:40:26.511
Yes.

00:40:29.345 --> 00:40:31.095
Brother Mintu has hit the jackpot!

00:40:31.761 --> 00:40:34.594
He's found a wife in the guise
of a housekeeper.

00:40:34.595 --> 00:40:35.345
[laughter]

00:40:35.511 --> 00:40:36.636
Speak carefully!

00:40:37.261 --> 00:40:38.761
What if it comes true tomorrow?

00:40:39.470 --> 00:40:41.386
We need to get Mintu married soon!

00:40:41.761 --> 00:40:44.136
My sister-in-law's sister, Sandhya.
Shall I talk to her family?

00:40:44.261 --> 00:40:47.761
Why are you all so obsessed
with getting him married?

00:40:47.886 --> 00:40:50.719
He's living a wonderful life.

00:40:50.720 --> 00:40:51.594
Let him enjoy it!

00:40:51.595 --> 00:40:53.761
Why burden him with responsibilities
for the future already?

00:40:54.095 --> 00:40:57.595
Besides, we can't just transfer such
a huge property into the name

00:40:57.720 --> 00:41:00.345
of some unknown girl after
getting him married, can we?

00:41:00.761 --> 00:41:03.010
He's living with someone
without getting married.

00:41:03.011 --> 00:41:03.886
Let him be!

00:41:04.386 --> 00:41:05.761
Let him live in with her.

00:41:06.386 --> 00:41:07.345
What?

00:41:08.095 --> 00:41:08.886
Live-in?

00:41:09.261 --> 00:41:09.886
What else?

00:41:10.011 --> 00:41:11.761
If not today, then tomorrow,
that's what'll happen anyway!

00:41:11.886 --> 00:41:12.886
That's good, isn't it?

00:41:13.261 --> 00:41:14.760
He'll save on wedding expenses.

00:41:14.761 --> 00:41:16.886
It's the trend these days, brother-in-law.

00:41:17.011 --> 00:41:17.636
[laughter]

00:41:17.761 --> 00:41:18.720
Listen!

00:41:19.511 --> 00:41:22.136
Keep that Punjabi broad-mindedness
to yourself.

00:41:22.761 --> 00:41:24.094
Don't corrupt them with your ideas.

00:41:24.095 --> 00:41:25.510
We don't allow such things in our family.

00:41:25.511 --> 00:41:26.886
You and your fried snacks.

00:41:27.011 --> 00:41:29.010
Don't ever let anyone eat butter chicken!

00:41:29.011 --> 00:41:30.011
[laughter]

00:41:30.636 --> 00:41:32.136
Punjabi broad-mindedness!

00:41:33.886 --> 00:41:35.261
Can I have half a cup of tea?

00:41:35.470 --> 00:41:36.136
This has gone cold.

00:41:36.261 --> 00:41:37.011
Sure.

00:41:37.136 --> 00:41:38.386
Okay, she's coming.

00:41:43.511 --> 00:41:44.345
Here it is.

00:41:47.386 --> 00:41:49.386
Take this.

00:41:49.636 --> 00:41:53.386
This is for Pinky, this is for Babli,
and this is yours, sister.

00:41:53.595 --> 00:41:54.511
Bless you!

00:41:56.095 --> 00:41:56.970
What's this, brother? - Yes.

00:41:57.720 --> 00:41:59.386
We won't settle for just money this time.

00:41:59.720 --> 00:42:01.261
Now, we want a sister-in-law!

00:42:02.136 --> 00:42:04.761
I'll talk to my sister-in-law
about her sister, Sandhya.

00:42:04.886 --> 00:42:07.595
Don't you want to see me happy?

00:42:07.845 --> 00:42:09.970
Let me live independently.
That's what's right for me.

00:42:10.720 --> 00:42:13.845
By the way,
how has your experience been?

00:42:16.761 --> 00:42:18.260
It's been satisfactory.

00:42:18.261 --> 00:42:21.261
[laughter]

00:42:22.886 --> 00:42:24.011
It's fantastic!

00:42:24.886 --> 00:42:26.386
Fantastic!

00:42:27.636 --> 00:42:29.095
Enough joking around.

00:42:29.470 --> 00:42:32.260
Now, you've found a good
housekeeper in Helen.

00:42:32.261 --> 00:42:34.636
Once you get a sister-in-law for us,
she'll have some company, too.

00:42:34.761 --> 00:42:37.595
You'll get married someday as well, right?

00:42:38.011 --> 00:42:39.636
How long will she stay here?

00:42:39.845 --> 00:42:41.720
Right?
Think about it seriously!

00:42:48.136 --> 00:42:49.261
All right.

00:42:49.720 --> 00:42:51.511
I'll think about it after Diwali.

00:42:53.886 --> 00:42:55.886
[dog barks]

00:42:56.011 --> 00:42:56.969
Here you go, sir.

00:42:56.970 --> 00:43:00.094
No, thanks.
Honestly, I'm full, but...

00:43:00.095 --> 00:43:02.469
My heart wants one more flatbread.

00:43:02.470 --> 00:43:05.345
- Right away!
- You got magical hands! The taste...

00:43:06.011 --> 00:43:07.886
Your sister is right.

00:43:08.261 --> 00:43:10.720
I will train your wife and leave.

00:43:11.261 --> 00:43:14.970
No. Whoever she is,
she would also know cooking.

00:43:15.720 --> 00:43:18.760
Maybe the taste won't be as good as yours.

00:43:18.761 --> 00:43:20.511
Shall I spend my entire life
over here with you,

00:43:20.636 --> 00:43:21.886
just to serve you tasty food?

00:43:23.761 --> 00:43:25.761
And not fulfil my dreams?

00:43:26.386 --> 00:43:27.886
Not possible, sir.

00:43:46.595 --> 00:43:47.720
Sir...

00:43:48.720 --> 00:43:50.720
[screams]

00:43:51.761 --> 00:43:53.886
'Mr. Dubey is as pure as snow.'

00:43:54.011 --> 00:43:55.386
'You might fall on him,'

00:43:55.761 --> 00:43:57.261
'but he'd never fall on you.'

00:43:57.511 --> 00:43:58.511
'I guarantee.'

00:43:58.636 --> 00:44:01.511
[laughs]

00:44:01.970 --> 00:44:02.886
Sir...

00:44:03.511 --> 00:44:06.011
Why did you come here?
I was just bringing your flatbreads.

00:44:07.261 --> 00:44:11.095
I came to tell you that

00:44:11.261 --> 00:44:14.095
you can stay here
for as long as you want.

00:44:14.720 --> 00:44:18.136
I won't force you to stay back.

00:44:20.970 --> 00:44:21.886
Okay, sir.

00:44:25.011 --> 00:44:27.386
Sir, can I get up?

00:44:28.761 --> 00:44:30.386
Yes. Please.

00:44:31.261 --> 00:44:36.636
Sir, I can only get up if you let go.

00:44:38.511 --> 00:44:41.095
- Oh.. oh...
- Thank you, sir.

00:44:43.636 --> 00:44:46.011
I didn't realize it while balancing.

00:44:46.136 --> 00:44:48.720
- Here's your flatbread.
- Yes, the flatbread.

00:44:51.761 --> 00:44:53.470
Yes, the flatbread.

00:44:55.636 --> 00:44:56.761
- Sir.
- Yes.

00:44:56.970 --> 00:44:57.970
Did you get hurt?

00:44:58.136 --> 00:44:59.636
No. I'm fine.

00:45:07.511 --> 00:45:11.511
[upbeat music]

00:45:28.511 --> 00:45:30.761
'Sir, can I get up?'

00:45:31.761 --> 00:45:33.761
[upbeat music]

00:46:40.636 --> 00:46:42.511
Why the hell isn't
it showing double ticks?

00:47:03.511 --> 00:47:05.386
[phone rings]

00:47:05.511 --> 00:47:06.386
Hello!

00:47:06.761 --> 00:47:07.595
Helen!

00:47:07.720 --> 00:47:08.636
Yes, sir.

00:47:09.136 --> 00:47:16.345
I thought, why bother typing so much
when I could just call you?

00:47:17.761 --> 00:47:18.885
Good thinking, sir.

00:47:18.886 --> 00:47:20.011
Go ahead!

00:47:21.011 --> 00:47:26.886
So, we have asafoetida,
black pepper and eggs, right?

00:47:28.136 --> 00:47:30.011
Yes, sir.
We have everything at home.

00:47:30.386 --> 00:47:35.761
Very good!
Then make egg pepper fry today.

00:47:36.386 --> 00:47:37.886
Sure, sir. I'll make it.

00:47:38.886 --> 00:47:41.386
So, uh...

00:47:42.761 --> 00:47:44.761
have you finished all the housework?

00:47:45.261 --> 00:47:46.345
Yes, sir.

00:47:46.511 --> 00:47:50.344
Actually,
I was getting bored sitting around.

00:47:50.345 --> 00:47:53.845
So I thought I'd iron some clothes.

00:47:54.720 --> 00:48:00.136
If you're bored, why don't you go out
somewhere and look around?

00:48:01.386 --> 00:48:02.969
Sir, where would I go?

00:48:02.970 --> 00:48:04.635
I don't even know anyone here.

00:48:04.636 --> 00:48:05.845
I'm fine, sir.

00:48:06.136 --> 00:48:07.136
Then let's do one thing.

00:48:07.261 --> 00:48:08.886
I don't have workload in the office

00:48:09.136 --> 00:48:11.761
and I'm also not in mood to work today.

00:48:11.970 --> 00:48:13.386
So, I will come home.

00:48:13.511 --> 00:48:15.636
We'll go together,
you'll get an outing, too.

00:48:15.761 --> 00:48:17.719
No, sir.
Don't worry about me.

00:48:17.720 --> 00:48:19.095
I'm fine.

00:48:19.261 --> 00:48:23.720
No... no... don't worry.

00:48:24.095 --> 00:48:27.761
It will be an outing for you
as well as me.

00:48:29.386 --> 00:48:30.511
Hello, Mr. Ranjan.

00:48:30.970 --> 00:48:32.011
Excuse me.

00:48:33.386 --> 00:48:34.386
Is it a good time?

00:48:34.511 --> 00:48:35.886
Yes. Yes.

00:48:36.386 --> 00:48:39.595
Actually, I was thinking of going out
to grab a coffee.

00:48:40.011 --> 00:48:41.720
Would you like to join?

00:48:42.261 --> 00:48:43.677
Well, I'll let you know in five minutes.

00:48:43.678 --> 00:48:48.386
I might be making
plans with a friend, too.

00:48:49.970 --> 00:48:52.011
Sure, just let me know.

00:48:52.386 --> 00:48:53.511
Sure.

00:48:53.761 --> 00:48:54.595
Okay.

00:48:57.136 --> 00:48:59.094
- Yes, hello!
- Sir... sir, sir!

00:48:59.095 --> 00:49:00.011
Yes.

00:49:00.136 --> 00:49:02.886
She's that high-society lady
from the other night, right?

00:49:03.595 --> 00:49:04.345
Hmm.

00:49:04.511 --> 00:49:07.344
Sir, she's definitely asking
you out for coffee

00:49:07.345 --> 00:49:09.011
because she's got her eye on you.

00:49:10.011 --> 00:49:10.969
Sir, here's what you should do.

00:49:10.970 --> 00:49:12.886
Tell me where to meet you,
and I'll come along.

00:49:13.095 --> 00:49:16.720
Meet me outside Regale mall.

00:49:17.136 --> 00:49:18.261
Sure, sir. Done.

00:49:48.720 --> 00:49:49.719
Hello, sir.

00:49:49.720 --> 00:49:51.636
Hello! Haven't you arrived yet?

00:49:51.761 --> 00:49:52.969
I'm already here, sir!

00:49:52.970 --> 00:49:55.761
I've been waiting for you
for the last ten minutes, sir.

00:49:56.136 --> 00:49:58.595
I'm already here.
But I can't see you.

00:49:59.095 --> 00:50:01.136
I've lifted my hand.
Just see.

00:50:01.386 --> 00:50:02.386
Yes, sir.

00:50:03.970 --> 00:50:05.720
Hey, sir. I saw you.

00:50:06.470 --> 00:50:07.511
Coming.

00:50:08.261 --> 00:50:09.386
Hello, sir.

00:50:13.595 --> 00:50:14.760
Oh, I'd spotted you.

00:50:14.761 --> 00:50:17.720
But I just couldn't recognize you
in those clothes.

00:50:17.970 --> 00:50:21.636
You look completely different,
like a working woman.

00:50:21.886 --> 00:50:23.886
Of course, I'm a working lady, sir.

00:50:24.470 --> 00:50:26.011
In housekeeping.

00:50:27.136 --> 00:50:30.761
- I am a good bike rider. So, I...
- Okay, sir.

00:50:35.761 --> 00:50:38.136
Would you ride on my bike?

00:50:39.386 --> 00:50:40.470
Yes, sir.

00:50:40.761 --> 00:50:41.511
Hmm.

00:50:52.261 --> 00:50:53.511
Sir.

00:50:53.720 --> 00:50:56.720
You said we are going to meet a friend.

00:50:58.511 --> 00:50:59.385
Yes.

00:50:59.386 --> 00:51:00.511
Which friend, sir?

00:51:00.720 --> 00:51:02.345
Well... that...

00:51:06.345 --> 00:51:07.761
This is that friend.

00:51:09.761 --> 00:51:10.970
Sir.

00:51:12.136 --> 00:51:13.011
Shall we?

00:51:13.261 --> 00:51:14.136
Yes, sir.

00:51:19.386 --> 00:51:21.095
Sir...

00:51:22.011 --> 00:51:31.511
<i>♪ When I wrote your name and erased it,
I missed you. ♪</i>

00:51:33.720 --> 00:51:43.970
<i>♪ When I wrote your name and erased it,
I missed you. ♪</i>

00:51:44.886 --> 00:51:51.261
<i>♪ When I embraced your photo, ♪</i>

00:51:51.386 --> 00:52:01.720
<i>♪ When I embraced your photo, ♪</i>

00:52:03.386 --> 00:52:08.844
<i>♪ I missed you. ♪</i>

00:52:08.845 --> 00:52:11.886
This veggie Cheese Burst.

00:52:15.595 --> 00:52:18.011
What's the name of it?

00:52:18.261 --> 00:52:19.845
Cheese Brust pizza.

00:52:20.095 --> 00:52:21.720
Sir, burst.

00:52:22.345 --> 00:52:24.260
Which means it's loaded with cheese.

00:52:24.261 --> 00:52:25.636
Oh.

00:52:27.511 --> 00:52:28.511
Wow!

00:52:30.636 --> 00:52:32.635
What else do you like to eat?

00:52:32.636 --> 00:52:38.261
Sir, I love pasta.
And noodles that you get in mountains.

00:52:38.511 --> 00:52:43.011
Veg Manchurian and momo, sir.

00:52:43.136 --> 00:52:44.720
With spicy chutney.

00:52:46.761 --> 00:52:48.095
Great!

00:52:49.511 --> 00:52:50.636
And you, sir?

00:52:50.761 --> 00:52:54.510
'Chaat' (tangy mixture), potato patty,
'Chole Bhature.' (Chickpeas with fried bun)

00:52:54.511 --> 00:52:58.136
- 'Golgappa' (water balls),
- Yes, water balls and all that...

00:52:59.720 --> 00:53:02.845
- Next time, we'll eat all of those, sir.
- Yes, sure.

00:53:12.386 --> 00:53:17.886
<i>♪ I never had seen such colours
in my life before. ♪</i>

00:53:18.136 --> 00:53:24.011
<i>♪ I never felt this way before. ♪</i>

00:53:24.136 --> 00:53:30.011
<i>♪ The paths were the same,
but they were never so lovely. ♪</i>

00:53:30.136 --> 00:53:36.470
<i>♪ Life had never touched me
this way before. ♪</i>

00:53:38.261 --> 00:53:43.761
<i>♪ All seasons seem beautiful now. ♪</i>

00:53:44.011 --> 00:53:49.886
<i>♪ Ever since you became mine, beloved. ♪</i>

00:53:50.136 --> 00:53:55.636
<i>♪ In my lonely life, ♪</i>

00:53:56.136 --> 00:54:01.511
<i>♪ you brought immense love. ♪</i>

00:54:01.761 --> 00:54:08.760
<i>♪ The love hidden in my heart ♪</i>

00:54:08.761 --> 00:54:13.011
<i>♪ dwells in my eyes now. ♪</i>

00:54:13.261 --> 00:54:24.010
<i>♪ When I embraced your photo, ♪</i>

00:54:24.011 --> 00:54:30.720
<i>♪ I missed you. ♪</i>

00:54:31.636 --> 00:54:38.220
<i>♪ I saw the moon hidden behind the clouds. ♪</i>

00:54:38.345 --> 00:54:41.970
<i>♪ And I missed you. ♪</i>

00:55:02.928 --> 00:55:04.344
Okay. Goodnight, sir.

00:55:04.345 --> 00:55:05.011
Goodnight?

00:55:06.345 --> 00:55:07.261
So soon?

00:55:08.136 --> 00:55:09.594
It's not soon, sir.

00:55:09.595 --> 00:55:10.511
It's late!

00:55:10.720 --> 00:55:11.886
Oh, I see.

00:55:12.011 --> 00:55:13.011
Yes.

00:55:14.636 --> 00:55:17.720
Bed is ready in the courtyard
below the open sky.

00:55:18.136 --> 00:55:19.636
It's been quite late.

00:55:20.595 --> 00:55:22.636
Why am I not sleepy yet?

00:55:25.345 --> 00:55:26.345
Are you a poet?

00:55:27.261 --> 00:55:28.136
These days,

00:55:28.886 --> 00:55:30.345
it automatically emerges from my heart.

00:55:34.636 --> 00:55:35.470
Goodnight.

00:55:35.970 --> 00:55:36.886
Goodnight, sir.

00:56:02.470 --> 00:56:04.261
[doorbell rings]
[knocks]

00:56:06.511 --> 00:56:09.261
Does Manu Joshi live here?

00:56:11.886 --> 00:56:12.886
No.

00:56:13.761 --> 00:56:15.470
See this first

00:56:16.636 --> 00:56:17.636
and tell me.

00:56:17.886 --> 00:56:18.886
Look at her.

00:56:19.095 --> 00:56:20.635
Isn't she beautiful?

00:56:20.636 --> 00:56:22.720
That's Helen.

00:56:23.095 --> 00:56:26.011
And the woman making that reel
is Tamanna Pandey, our neighbour.

00:56:26.136 --> 00:56:27.470
She's always making reels.

00:56:28.595 --> 00:56:30.136
She's no Helen.

00:56:30.386 --> 00:56:31.761
She's Manu Joshi,

00:56:32.261 --> 00:56:34.345
who fled from Delhi and came here.

00:56:34.636 --> 00:56:37.011
No, no! You must be mistaken.

00:56:37.136 --> 00:56:38.011
- She's...
- Sir.

00:56:38.761 --> 00:56:39.886
She's right.

00:56:59.970 --> 00:57:02.636
My full name is Manu Joshi.

00:57:09.470 --> 00:57:15.636
I grew up in a small town
in Uttarakhand called Ranikhet.

00:57:16.386 --> 00:57:18.595
My father, Satish Joshi,

00:57:19.136 --> 00:57:22.886
runs a small motor garage there.

00:57:24.470 --> 00:57:26.970
My mother, Indu Joshi, is a homemaker.

00:57:27.720 --> 00:57:29.386
After graduation,

00:57:29.720 --> 00:57:33.011
I started working at a hotel in Ranikhet,

00:57:33.470 --> 00:57:35.511
handling the front desk and housekeeping.

00:57:36.095 --> 00:57:39.136
One day, I saw an ad in the newspaper

00:57:39.595 --> 00:57:42.261
for an air hostess academy in Dehradun.

00:57:43.386 --> 00:57:45.011
I convinced my parents and

00:57:45.761 --> 00:57:47.386
moved to Dehradun.

00:57:49.761 --> 00:57:51.970
That's where I met Kailash,

00:57:52.136 --> 00:57:54.511
who worked there.

00:57:54.720 --> 00:57:59.386
He told me not to waste
my money and time there and

00:58:00.011 --> 00:58:02.719
suggested I move to Delhi,

00:58:02.720 --> 00:58:06.636
where the branch offered 100% placement.

00:58:07.636 --> 00:58:11.011
I knew I was my parents' darling daughter.

00:58:12.970 --> 00:58:16.136
They won't be convinced to send me
all the way to Delhi. So...

00:58:17.886 --> 00:58:21.761
I reached Delhi without telling them.

00:58:22.636 --> 00:58:26.595
Next day, Kailash took me
to a farmhouse in Chhatarpur,

00:58:26.845 --> 00:58:30.094
where interviews for the admissions
were about to begin.

00:58:30.095 --> 00:58:31.011
Come!

00:58:37.345 --> 00:58:38.261
Come!

00:58:41.636 --> 00:58:42.595
What happened?

00:58:43.386 --> 00:58:44.594
Are they taking the interview over here?

00:58:44.595 --> 00:58:46.095
Yes, please, come.

00:58:47.136 --> 00:58:49.886
It looks like party arrangements.

00:58:50.261 --> 00:58:53.345
Bungalows of this locality
are usually rented out

00:58:53.595 --> 00:58:55.511
for marriage and party and all that.

00:58:55.761 --> 00:58:56.761
So, also for interviews!

00:58:57.720 --> 00:58:59.845
This is Delhi.
That's how things go on over here.

00:59:00.720 --> 00:59:02.510
- Okay.
- You wait there.

00:59:02.511 --> 00:59:04.261
I will bring a form from inside.

00:59:04.720 --> 00:59:05.845
- Yes.
- Okay?

00:59:08.511 --> 00:59:10.136
Let her wait here. I will be back.

00:59:10.845 --> 00:59:12.303
Keep it.

00:59:18.511 --> 00:59:19.970
How do you like the farmhouse?

00:59:22.636 --> 00:59:23.720
Hello, sir.

00:59:23.970 --> 00:59:25.386
It's beautiful, sir.

00:59:26.595 --> 00:59:27.636
Is it yours?

00:59:27.970 --> 00:59:28.886
Ours.

00:59:29.511 --> 00:59:30.094
Nice.

00:59:30.095 --> 00:59:31.720
These are my two sons.

00:59:32.470 --> 00:59:35.136
- Hello!
- And she's my eldest daughter-in-law.

00:59:35.595 --> 00:59:36.470
Hello!

00:59:38.386 --> 00:59:40.970
We are getting married today.
Kailash must have told you.

00:59:42.011 --> 00:59:43.761
These arrangements are for the same.

00:59:43.886 --> 00:59:45.511
Are you getting married, sir?

00:59:46.761 --> 00:59:49.720
That's nice.
Well, Kailash didn't tell me.

00:59:51.011 --> 00:59:52.511
You and I.

00:59:54.220 --> 00:59:56.011
[laughs]

00:59:57.636 --> 01:00:00.511
Sir, what are you saying?

01:00:00.636 --> 01:00:02.845
Why are you speaking weirdly, sir?

01:00:03.470 --> 01:00:07.720
Sir, I've come here
for an air hostess interview.

01:00:09.011 --> 01:00:11.595
Kailash said everything is clear.

01:00:12.011 --> 01:00:14.470
That... one... what do they say?

01:00:14.636 --> 01:00:15.386
Financially weak, dad.

01:00:15.511 --> 01:00:17.636
Yes, your family is
financially weak, right?

01:00:18.470 --> 01:00:20.095
You're in need of money at home.

01:00:20.886 --> 01:00:23.511
No, sir.
I think there's some confusion, sir. I...

01:00:23.761 --> 01:00:25.761
I will show you a note.

01:00:27.136 --> 01:00:29.386
Sir, I think you've a misunderstanding.

01:00:29.636 --> 01:00:30.636
Please, sir. I...

01:00:30.970 --> 01:00:34.386
I've come here for transfer
to the Delhi branch, so...

01:00:34.761 --> 01:00:37.386
Kailash said I will get 100% placement.

01:00:37.761 --> 01:00:39.886
Sir, there's some confusion.

01:00:40.386 --> 01:00:43.970
Sir... just a second, sir.
Let me call up Kailash.

01:00:48.845 --> 01:00:50.220
[phone rings]

01:00:57.386 --> 01:00:59.511
He's such a despicable man.

01:01:01.261 --> 01:01:04.011
Look at the name
he saved your number under.

01:01:05.470 --> 01:01:07.636
"No. 1 Item from Dehradun!"

01:01:08.845 --> 01:01:09.970
Good!

01:01:10.386 --> 01:01:12.345
We had his phone
confiscated before he left.

01:01:14.011 --> 01:01:15.386
Just a minute.

01:01:16.761 --> 01:01:19.886
Did both of you hatch this plan

01:01:22.011 --> 01:01:22.886
to trick me?

01:01:23.011 --> 01:01:24.345
No, sir.

01:01:24.720 --> 01:01:26.386
He took cash from me.

01:01:27.011 --> 01:01:30.720
Sir, I've no idea about any cash.

01:01:31.761 --> 01:01:34.761
I mean it, sir. Believe me.

01:01:35.136 --> 01:01:38.970
Call Kailash.
Everything will be cleared. Sir.

01:01:47.636 --> 01:01:49.345
He took 10 lakhs from me.

01:01:51.720 --> 01:01:53.886
He said he will give 8 lakhs
to your family.

01:01:56.011 --> 01:01:57.095
Alright.

01:01:58.386 --> 01:02:01.511
Return 10 lakhs and you're free to go.

01:02:02.261 --> 01:02:05.886
Sir, I don't have money.

01:02:06.845 --> 01:02:09.011
How will I pay you, sir?

01:02:10.386 --> 01:02:12.970
Sir, please. Sir, please.

01:02:13.136 --> 01:02:16.470
Invitations have already gone out
for tonight's wedding.

01:02:16.761 --> 01:02:18.095
Sir, please. Sir!

01:02:18.386 --> 01:02:21.511
Tell my daughter-in-law
whatever you want from the market,

01:02:21.720 --> 01:02:23.136
and she'll get it for you.

01:02:26.636 --> 01:02:27.720
Please.

01:02:29.470 --> 01:02:32.635
Sir, please. Sir, please.

01:02:32.636 --> 01:02:34.720
Stop pleading now.

01:02:35.095 --> 01:02:37.011
Can't you understand what I said?

01:02:37.595 --> 01:02:39.010
Sir, sorry, sir. Please, sir.

01:02:39.011 --> 01:02:41.011
Do you think I am a fool?

01:02:41.761 --> 01:02:43.511
Get her ready for the wedding.

01:02:47.345 --> 01:02:48.386
Please.

01:02:49.595 --> 01:02:50.636
Please.

01:03:04.511 --> 01:03:05.845
- Listen.
- Yes.

01:03:06.595 --> 01:03:07.761
Is she ready?

01:03:08.011 --> 01:03:09.095
Yes.

01:03:09.720 --> 01:03:11.136
So, bring her out.

01:03:13.178 --> 01:03:14.803
[sobs]

01:03:54.636 --> 01:03:55.720
Please.

01:03:59.845 --> 01:04:01.011
Please, sister.

01:04:27.970 --> 01:04:30.636
Storeroom's window opens
into the backyard.

01:04:33.636 --> 01:04:34.720
Run away.

01:04:35.053 --> 01:04:36.803
[sombre music]

01:04:44.053 --> 01:04:45.220
[sobs]

01:04:46.261 --> 01:04:47.261
Water!

01:04:47.845 --> 01:04:49.136
No, sir. Thank you.

01:04:56.136 --> 01:04:57.136
Sorry.

01:05:02.761 --> 01:05:04.720
I ran away from there.

01:05:05.511 --> 01:05:08.345
I knew I couldn't go back home.

01:05:08.970 --> 01:05:11.470
I didn't have the courage
to face my parents.

01:05:12.511 --> 01:05:15.344
I also thought that those people
might find out my address

01:05:15.345 --> 01:05:20.345
and show up there,
demanding that my parents

01:05:21.470 --> 01:05:25.011
repay the money Kailash
had taken from them.

01:05:26.095 --> 01:05:30.886
And my parents don't
have that kind of money, sir.

01:05:32.595 --> 01:05:36.511
Since I knew housekeeping,

01:05:37.095 --> 01:05:39.511
I thought I'd find a job in that field

01:05:39.761 --> 01:05:43.011
and go underground for a few days.

01:05:43.886 --> 01:05:48.136
I found Mr. Pandey's video.

01:05:49.761 --> 01:05:54.594
There was free food
and accommodation,

01:05:54.595 --> 01:05:58.636
so I thought it was the perfect place
to hide for a while.

01:06:00.511 --> 01:06:05.761
Sir, I caught a train to Lucknow.

01:06:08.595 --> 01:06:09.720
Look at that!

01:06:10.970 --> 01:06:14.511
He contacted the police there
and sent us this reel,

01:06:15.511 --> 01:06:17.635
claiming that a missing
girl from his family

01:06:17.636 --> 01:06:19.511
was living within our jurisdiction.

01:06:19.761 --> 01:06:23.261
We came here thinking we'd reunite
a missing girl with her family.

01:06:24.011 --> 01:06:26.761
But the story turned out
to be the exact opposite.

01:06:29.636 --> 01:06:31.761
Anyway, come with us.

01:06:32.011 --> 01:06:35.345
For now,
we'll place you in a women's shelter.

01:06:35.511 --> 01:06:36.761
You'll be safe there.

01:06:42.886 --> 01:06:43.845
Madam,

01:06:44.720 --> 01:06:46.720
I feel safe here.

01:06:46.845 --> 01:06:49.136
I want to stay here. Please.

01:06:50.345 --> 01:06:52.761
Alright. That's fine.

01:06:54.386 --> 01:06:56.636
Just don't make any more reels like this.

01:06:57.761 --> 01:06:59.635
For your own safety,

01:06:59.636 --> 01:07:01.761
confidentiality is very important.

01:07:02.720 --> 01:07:04.011
Is that clear?

01:07:04.470 --> 01:07:05.302
[sighs]

01:07:05.303 --> 01:07:06.636
Alright, Mr. Ranjan.

01:07:07.470 --> 01:07:08.969
Make sure that video gets deleted.

01:07:08.970 --> 01:07:11.511
Sure. She's sister-in-law Bijli.

01:07:11.720 --> 01:07:14.094
Please, come. She keeps making reels.
She's very much into it.

01:07:14.095 --> 01:07:15.303
[chuckles]

01:07:24.720 --> 01:07:27.720
You went through so much
and reached here.

01:07:29.386 --> 01:07:31.136
But you never expressed it.

01:07:33.511 --> 01:07:35.511
Sorry, Helen... I mean, Manu.

01:07:35.761 --> 01:07:38.677
Inadvertently,
you ended up getting misused here.

01:07:38.678 --> 01:07:41.385
Hereafter, I will hire someone else
for the household chores.

01:07:41.386 --> 01:07:43.261
No, sir. Please.

01:07:43.386 --> 01:07:46.720
To you, I'm still Helen,
and I'm still your housekeeper.

01:07:47.345 --> 01:07:51.095
Sir, I send the money you pay me
to my father.

01:07:51.386 --> 01:07:53.011
We really need it.

01:07:53.511 --> 01:07:55.636
So, please don't make me unemployed.
Please.

01:07:56.011 --> 01:07:57.011
And sir.

01:07:57.136 --> 01:07:59.761
please don't tell anyone
about my real identity.

01:08:00.136 --> 01:08:01.636
Oh, come on.

01:08:01.761 --> 01:08:03.511
Stop worrying about the finance.

01:08:03.761 --> 01:08:06.844
You were special to me
when you were Helen,

01:08:06.845 --> 01:08:09.345
and you're still special
to me as Manu Joshi.

01:08:09.511 --> 01:08:12.386
Sir, then let me continue working.

01:08:12.636 --> 01:08:16.720
What will people say if someone else
starts working here while I'm still around?

01:08:17.386 --> 01:08:19.386
How will I justify staying here then, sir?

01:08:19.636 --> 01:08:23.011
You don't need anyone's permission
to live here, Manu.

01:08:23.636 --> 01:08:26.011
This house is as much yours as it's mine.

01:08:26.136 --> 01:08:28.886
Stay as long as you want.

01:08:29.636 --> 01:08:31.886
And yes.
To the world, you'll remain Helen,

01:08:32.095 --> 01:08:34.761
but to me, you'll be Manu Joshi.

01:08:35.386 --> 01:08:36.720
Sir.

01:08:37.595 --> 01:08:38.761
Thank you, sir.

01:08:38.970 --> 01:08:43.136
You're a really good person.
Thank you. Thank you, sir.

01:08:44.511 --> 01:08:48.470
Sir! Sorry. I... You got late, today.
I'll prepare your breakfast.

01:08:57.845 --> 01:08:59.594
Sister, please sit down. I'll bring it.

01:08:59.595 --> 01:09:00.886
Oh, don't worry.

01:09:01.636 --> 01:09:02.720
I'm not a guest here.

01:09:03.761 --> 01:09:05.511
Since childhood,

01:09:05.720 --> 01:09:07.761
I've managed this kitchen all by myself.

01:09:08.261 --> 01:09:10.761
Every inch of it is arranged by me.

01:09:10.886 --> 01:09:11.886
[chuckles]

01:09:12.011 --> 01:09:13.720
Then I got married.

01:09:14.011 --> 01:09:16.094
And the charge was with Babli,
and finally with Pinky.

01:09:16.095 --> 01:09:17.761
You should also get settled now.

01:09:18.511 --> 01:09:20.261
How long will you keep doing this job?

01:09:20.761 --> 01:09:23.552
I'm already settled. I liked this place.

01:09:23.553 --> 01:09:24.636
[chuckles]

01:09:24.886 --> 01:09:27.761
Shall I find someone for you?
There's a boy I have in mind.

01:09:27.886 --> 01:09:29.261
He's a security guard at a bank.

01:09:29.386 --> 01:09:31.386
It's a government job with a pension.

01:09:31.761 --> 01:09:34.386
What more do we middle-class people want?

01:09:34.511 --> 01:09:38.511
No, sister, thank you.
I'm already in talks with someone.

01:09:38.720 --> 01:09:40.095
Really?

01:09:40.636 --> 01:09:42.344
Who is he? Tell us!

01:09:42.345 --> 01:09:44.386
Well, sister...

01:09:44.511 --> 01:09:46.220
[doorbell rings]

01:09:46.720 --> 01:09:48.011
Sir is here.

01:09:49.136 --> 01:09:50.386
Take this.

01:09:51.761 --> 01:09:53.720
You both are here?
Why didn't you call before coming?

01:09:54.136 --> 01:09:57.886
Why, brother? Do we need to call
before visiting our own home?

01:09:58.636 --> 01:10:00.760
No, I just meant you always
used to call before coming.

01:10:00.761 --> 01:10:01.885
That's why I asked you.

01:10:01.886 --> 01:10:03.970
You used to live alone then.

01:10:04.345 --> 01:10:07.720
We had to check
whether you'd be home to open the door.

01:10:07.845 --> 01:10:10.386
Now, we know Helen will be here.

01:10:10.511 --> 01:10:12.386
So, we didn't bother calling.
We just came directly.

01:10:12.511 --> 01:10:13.635
- Very good!
- Anyway,

01:10:13.636 --> 01:10:15.011
we came to invite you in person.

01:10:15.136 --> 01:10:16.261
For what?

01:10:16.386 --> 01:10:19.761
Lucky's tonsure ceremony is there
day after tomorrow. In a guesthouse.

01:10:20.136 --> 01:10:22.261
Take a day off from work.
You're his only maternal uncle.

01:10:22.386 --> 01:10:24.136
Why not tell me on the morning
of the ceremony itself?

01:10:24.261 --> 01:10:25.011
How fair is this!

01:10:25.136 --> 01:10:26.261
You're informing me just two days
in advance?

01:10:26.386 --> 01:10:28.386
We checked the almanac this morning
and finalized the date.

01:10:28.511 --> 01:10:29.761
If not done the day after tomorrow,

01:10:29.886 --> 01:10:32.136
he'll have to pass the entire summer
in long hair.

01:10:32.345 --> 01:10:33.635
I can't bear to see that.

01:10:33.636 --> 01:10:35.011
Anyway, we are late by four years.

01:10:35.136 --> 01:10:36.511
You be there on time.

01:10:36.761 --> 01:10:39.094
Alright. I will check my schedule
and let you know.

01:10:39.095 --> 01:10:40.469
As if you're a collector.

01:10:40.470 --> 01:10:42.636
Fine. I will be there. Happy?

01:10:43.386 --> 01:10:44.386
Thank you.

01:10:46.261 --> 01:10:47.136
Thank you.

01:10:47.470 --> 01:10:48.969
Am I supposed to come alone?

01:10:48.970 --> 01:10:50.386
Of course!

01:10:50.761 --> 01:10:52.719
If you'd married on time,

01:10:52.720 --> 01:10:55.969
we would have invited you and your wife!

01:10:55.970 --> 01:10:57.053
[chuckles]

01:10:57.470 --> 01:10:59.011
You should come too, Helen.

01:10:59.136 --> 01:11:00.261
Okay, sister.

01:11:00.636 --> 01:11:01.636
Do come.

01:11:04.511 --> 01:11:06.760
Wear a nice suit. Okay?

01:11:06.761 --> 01:11:07.886
Yes, sister.

01:11:12.261 --> 01:11:13.345
Come.

01:11:16.386 --> 01:11:17.386
Hey!

01:11:18.345 --> 01:11:21.010
Wow, Helen! Beautiful suit!

01:11:21.011 --> 01:11:22.470
Thank you, sister.

01:11:22.636 --> 01:11:24.136
Men are on that side, brother.

01:11:25.386 --> 01:11:26.761
You're also looking handsome.

01:11:27.345 --> 01:11:28.595
Come with me.

01:11:29.720 --> 01:11:30.761
Look there!

01:11:30.886 --> 01:11:34.386
Brother Mintu has arrived
with his live-in partner.

01:11:34.761 --> 01:11:37.761
Greetings, living legend!

01:11:38.511 --> 01:11:41.511
What's this? You're so late.
You're the only uncle.

01:11:41.636 --> 01:11:43.469
- Due to the traffic jam...
- I see.

01:11:43.470 --> 01:11:47.761
Come. Lucky was waiting for you.
He enquired about you several times.

01:12:06.928 --> 01:12:09.261
[upbeat music]

01:12:43.636 --> 01:12:45.720
Give us some token
on this happy occasion.

01:12:50.595 --> 01:12:52.844
<i>♪ Grumpy aunt has come. ♪</i>

01:12:52.845 --> 01:12:55.594
<i>♪ Another aunt is sulking. ♪</i>

01:12:55.595 --> 01:12:59.720
<i>♪ Son-in-law has a lot of attitude. ♪</i>

01:13:00.136 --> 01:13:04.136
<i>♪ Sister-in-law
is teasing her brother-in-law. ♪</i>

01:13:05.261 --> 01:13:07.635
<i>♪ Willingly or unwilling, ♪</i>

01:13:07.636 --> 01:13:12.095
<i>♪ They congratulate the couple. ♪</i>

01:13:12.886 --> 01:13:16.261
<i>♪ She snatched everything ♪</i>

01:13:16.386 --> 01:13:19.761
<i>♪ when she locked eyes with me. ♪</i>

01:13:19.886 --> 01:13:23.760
<i>♪ She snatched everything ♪</i>

01:13:23.761 --> 01:13:27.136
<i>♪ when she locked eyes with me. ♪</i>

01:13:27.386 --> 01:13:32.011
<i>♪ when she locked eyes with me. ♪</i>

01:13:32.136 --> 01:13:36.844
<i>♪ when she locked eyes with me. ♪</i>

01:13:36.845 --> 01:13:40.261
<i>♪ She drove me crazy ♪</i>

01:13:40.470 --> 01:13:43.886
<i>♪ when she locked eyes with me. ♪</i>

01:13:52.636 --> 01:13:53.886
<i>♪ Do your eyes have me under their spell? ♪</i>

01:13:54.011 --> 01:13:55.344
<i>♪ Do your eyes cast black magic? ♪</i>

01:13:55.345 --> 01:13:57.636
<i>♪ Before I met your eyes, I was a saint. ♪</i>

01:13:57.761 --> 01:13:58.885
<i>♪ Shall I sing songs for you? ♪</i>

01:13:58.886 --> 01:14:00.136
<i>♪ Shall I bring you the stars? ♪</i>

01:14:00.261 --> 01:14:02.469
<i>♪ You torture me whenever our eyes meet. ♪</i>

01:14:02.470 --> 01:14:03.635
<i>♪ I swear on my mother, ♪</i>

01:14:03.636 --> 01:14:07.552
<i>♪ I'll take you shopping around
the market on my bicycle. ♪</i>

01:14:07.553 --> 01:14:08.719
<i>♪ Ganj, Roomi Gate and every place. ♪</i>

01:14:08.720 --> 01:14:12.386
<i>♪ Shall I click your photos? ♪</i>

01:14:12.720 --> 01:14:14.594
<i>♪ I swear. I will listen only to you. ♪</i>

01:14:14.595 --> 01:14:17.510
<i>♪ And nobody else. ♪</i>

01:14:17.511 --> 01:14:19.260
<i>♪ I am really shy. ♪</i>

01:14:19.261 --> 01:14:22.470
<i>♪ Shall I explain if you don't understand? ♪</i>

01:14:22.636 --> 01:14:26.136
<i>♪ She snatched everything ♪</i>

01:14:26.261 --> 01:14:29.136
<i>♪ when she locked eyes with me. ♪</i>

01:14:39.136 --> 01:14:43.511
<i>♪ After showering love ♪</i>

01:14:44.011 --> 01:14:48.386
<i>♪ After showering love ♪</i>

01:14:48.511 --> 01:14:52.261
<i>♪ the monsoon remained parched. ♪</i>

01:14:53.136 --> 01:14:58.261
<i>♪ My body and my heart are sweetened. ♪</i>

01:14:58.386 --> 01:15:02.761
<i>♪ It spills over. ♪</i>

01:15:03.136 --> 01:15:07.011
<i>♪ She snatched everything ♪</i>

01:15:07.136 --> 01:15:10.386
<i>♪ when she locked eyes with me. ♪</i>

01:15:10.511 --> 01:15:12.761
<i>♪ when she locked eyes with me. ♪</i>

01:15:12.886 --> 01:15:15.720
<i>♪ when she locked eyes with me. ♪</i>

01:15:16.845 --> 01:15:19.886
<i>♪ Eyes. ♪</i>

01:15:24.886 --> 01:15:27.136
<i>♪ when she locked eyes with me. ♪</i>

01:15:27.386 --> 01:15:32.886
<i>♪ when she locked eyes with me. ♪</i>

01:15:33.011 --> 01:15:36.761
<i>♪ She drove me crazy ♪</i>

01:15:36.886 --> 01:15:40.345
<i>♪ when she locked eyes with me. ♪</i>

01:15:40.470 --> 01:15:43.261
<i>♪ She snatched everything ♪</i>

01:15:43.386 --> 01:15:45.511
<i>♪ when she locked eyes with me. ♪</i>

01:15:45.720 --> 01:15:47.761
<i>♪ when she locked eyes with me. ♪</i>

01:15:47.886 --> 01:15:50.095
<i>♪ when she locked eyes with me. ♪</i>

01:15:50.261 --> 01:15:53.386
<i>♪ when she locked eyes with me. ♪</i>

01:15:53.511 --> 01:15:57.845
<i>♪ I swear. I will listen only to you.
And nobody else. ♪</i>

01:15:58.386 --> 01:16:00.094
<i>♪ I am really shy. ♪</i>

01:16:00.095 --> 01:16:02.885
<i>♪ Shall I explain if you don't understand? ♪</i>

01:16:02.886 --> 01:16:06.720
Brother, my mother-in-law
is getting on my nerves.

01:16:06.886 --> 01:16:09.970
She keeps interfering in everything I do.

01:16:10.136 --> 01:16:11.511
She even wants me to massage her legs.

01:16:11.636 --> 01:16:12.969
You tell me, will I do that?

01:16:12.970 --> 01:16:15.386
And no modern daughter-in-law
would do that.

01:16:15.511 --> 01:16:16.720
Helen!

01:16:17.470 --> 01:16:18.886
How much time will it take?

01:16:19.345 --> 01:16:20.261
Please hurry up.

01:16:20.386 --> 01:16:22.677
There are so many dishes piled up
in the kitchen.

01:16:22.678 --> 01:16:25.136
Yes, sister. I'll do it. Don't worry.

01:16:25.511 --> 01:16:27.136
Are you listening to me, brother?

01:16:27.345 --> 01:16:27.885
Wait.

01:16:27.886 --> 01:16:29.636
Where's your attention?

01:16:30.511 --> 01:16:31.595
Hey!

01:16:35.761 --> 01:16:37.636
Give me that rolling pin. Give it to me.

01:16:37.761 --> 01:16:39.470
Where's he taking her?

01:16:40.886 --> 01:16:42.385
Where are you going?

01:16:42.386 --> 01:16:43.761
- Huh?
- Where are you going?

01:16:43.886 --> 01:16:44.886
Home!

01:16:45.136 --> 01:16:45.886
Home?

01:16:46.011 --> 01:16:47.011
So soon?

01:16:47.261 --> 01:16:48.761
We haven't even eaten yet.

01:16:48.886 --> 01:16:50.136
People are still taking the lunch.

01:16:50.261 --> 01:16:52.761
There's still so much work left.
How will we manage if she leaves?

01:16:53.136 --> 01:16:53.970
Oh, really?

01:16:54.136 --> 01:16:56.636
Did you tell her
she'd have to do all the work?

01:16:56.761 --> 01:16:57.761
Take this.

01:16:59.261 --> 01:17:00.761
How exactly did you invite her?

01:17:01.720 --> 01:17:03.011
You said, "You should come too, Helen!"

01:17:03.345 --> 01:17:04.720
I wasn't going to bring her.

01:17:05.136 --> 01:17:07.844
But then, I thought she
will get bored at home.

01:17:07.845 --> 01:17:10.761
I thought she'd enjoy herself here,
and get to experience a family function.

01:17:10.886 --> 01:17:11.970
Indeed she was enjoying.

01:17:12.636 --> 01:17:16.136
But you've put her to work
the moment she arrived.

01:17:18.636 --> 01:17:20.345
What are your own servants doing?

01:17:21.095 --> 01:17:22.095
Look at that one.

01:17:22.636 --> 01:17:23.386
Hey!

01:17:23.845 --> 01:17:25.761
Do you do gardening in the noon?

01:17:25.886 --> 01:17:28.136
This is a guesthouse.
Someone else will water the plants.

01:17:28.720 --> 01:17:30.386
And look at her!

01:17:31.136 --> 01:17:34.969
She's been standing beside the gifts,
like an Income Tax officer.

01:17:34.970 --> 01:17:36.720
Continue counting.

01:17:37.595 --> 01:17:39.470
And where's the other one?
Doing pastime?

01:17:39.595 --> 01:17:40.511
Yes, there.

01:17:40.636 --> 01:17:41.511
Look at him.

01:17:41.761 --> 01:17:44.511
He's busy on a call with his girlfriend.

01:17:45.261 --> 01:17:47.470
Did anyone even offer Helen a cup of tea?

01:17:48.595 --> 01:17:50.261
You did invite her as a guest, didn't you?

01:17:50.386 --> 01:17:52.720
Why are you taking
it so personally, brother?

01:17:52.886 --> 01:17:55.469
I'll pay her. It's not as if I'm making
her work for free.

01:17:55.470 --> 01:17:56.845
Is money everything, sister?

01:17:57.636 --> 01:17:59.885
People don't just hunger for money,
they need respect, too.

01:17:59.886 --> 01:18:02.677
You're feeling offended as if I have made
your wife work!

01:18:02.678 --> 01:18:03.677
Exactly.

01:18:03.678 --> 01:18:05.635
Even if she were my sister-in-law,
she'd have helped out, wouldn't she?

01:18:05.636 --> 01:18:06.636
Exactly!

01:18:06.761 --> 01:18:08.885
She's just doing what she is supposed to.

01:18:08.886 --> 01:18:10.011
What?

01:18:10.761 --> 01:18:12.761
Does her face reveal what she is?

01:18:13.886 --> 01:18:16.636
She belongs to extremely good family, sister.

01:18:16.761 --> 01:18:19.636
- Sir, please! It's all right...
- No, please stop.

01:18:20.970 --> 01:18:25.511
Is anyone born to do a particular job?

01:18:26.095 --> 01:18:28.595
Do they do it either out of passion
or out of compulsion?

01:18:28.845 --> 01:18:31.595
Is she born to work at your house?

01:18:32.386 --> 01:18:36.011
And what if I told you she's just
pretending to be a housekeeper?

01:18:36.136 --> 01:18:37.886
- What?
- Yes.

01:18:39.136 --> 01:18:40.510
Take a look in the mirror.

01:18:40.511 --> 01:18:43.386
You'll see who's pretending
to be something they're not.

01:18:44.386 --> 01:18:45.261
You!

01:18:46.136 --> 01:18:47.719
This is going too far now, brother Mintu!

01:18:47.720 --> 01:18:48.886
No, it isn't.

01:18:49.345 --> 01:18:50.761
I came for my nephew's tonsure.

01:18:51.136 --> 01:18:53.511
I did my duty. And now, I'm leaving.

01:18:55.886 --> 01:18:57.011
You all can continue.

01:18:57.636 --> 01:18:59.595
Bye! Come, let's go.

01:19:08.386 --> 01:19:12.011
Listen, yesterday you attended your
nephew's tonsure ceremony, right?

01:19:13.761 --> 01:19:14.761
Do you know?

01:19:15.761 --> 01:19:17.011
Helen wasn't at home.

01:19:17.845 --> 01:19:20.011
I think she sneaks out behind your back.

01:19:20.720 --> 01:19:22.886
There's definitely something fishy
going on with her.

01:19:23.386 --> 01:19:26.761
She went with me to Babita's house
for the tonsure ceremony.

01:19:26.886 --> 01:19:28.345
- Oh! I see.
- Yes.

01:19:30.845 --> 01:19:33.095
Tell me. Why did you go there

01:19:33.720 --> 01:19:35.011
when you knew I wasn't home?

01:19:35.636 --> 01:19:37.595
Why would I go?

01:19:37.761 --> 01:19:41.345
Tamanna went there
to make a reel with her.

01:19:41.761 --> 01:19:42.886
When Helen wasn't home,

01:19:43.886 --> 01:19:45.136
she was really upset.

01:19:46.761 --> 01:19:51.970
Helen won't make reels anymore.

01:19:53.470 --> 01:19:54.261
Why?

01:19:54.511 --> 01:19:57.136
Because I said so.

01:19:58.011 --> 01:19:59.095
By God!

01:19:59.511 --> 01:20:02.261
Mr. Dubey,
you're talking like her husband.

01:20:02.470 --> 01:20:03.928
[laughs]

01:20:04.095 --> 01:20:05.595
That's right.

01:20:05.970 --> 01:20:09.094
She's your employee, not your slave.

01:20:09.095 --> 01:20:10.720
That she would follow your orders.

01:20:11.011 --> 01:20:15.761
She herself said she doesn't like
this silly reel-making business.

01:20:18.761 --> 01:20:20.261
- Helen said that?
- Hmm.

01:20:23.636 --> 01:20:25.345
So, you're saying what
my wife does is silly?

01:20:25.511 --> 01:20:26.470
Not only Helen,

01:20:26.636 --> 01:20:32.386
even the WHO is going to announce
it a global pandemic soon.

01:20:32.720 --> 01:20:33.761
Announce what?

01:20:33.886 --> 01:20:35.011
This reels making.

01:20:35.595 --> 01:20:36.595
- I see.
- Yes.

01:20:36.886 --> 01:20:38.635
Global silly reel making business.

01:20:38.636 --> 01:20:40.761
[laughs]

01:20:41.636 --> 01:20:45.761
But you've disrespected my wife.

01:20:47.511 --> 01:20:49.720
Think whatever you want, Pandey.

01:20:51.595 --> 01:20:53.095
Continue with your lunch.

01:20:54.095 --> 01:20:56.886
- Where are you going?
- I'm there... over there...

01:20:57.386 --> 01:20:59.386
Hey, hello!

01:20:59.761 --> 01:21:01.761
Something's definitely off with Mr. Dubey.

01:21:02.886 --> 01:21:04.345
Yes, that's right.

01:21:04.761 --> 01:21:07.677
These days,
he arrives late and leaves early.

01:21:07.678 --> 01:21:09.845
- Hmm.
- Yes.

01:21:11.011 --> 01:21:12.261
Let me check out.

01:21:17.345 --> 01:21:18.345
Manu!

01:21:21.386 --> 01:21:22.386
Sir!

01:21:23.011 --> 01:21:24.095
Take this.

01:21:24.470 --> 01:21:25.511
What have you brought?

01:21:25.720 --> 01:21:26.845
See for yourself.

01:21:27.136 --> 01:21:28.261
Pizza!

01:21:30.636 --> 01:21:32.261
Cheese Burst.

01:21:32.720 --> 01:21:35.636
This is my favourite, sir! You remembered?

01:21:36.720 --> 01:21:39.095
And what about
all the food I've cooked, sir?

01:21:39.470 --> 01:21:40.885
Refrigerate it.

01:21:40.886 --> 01:21:43.177
I will give it away to all the hungry
colleagues in the office.

01:21:43.178 --> 01:21:44.302
[chuckles]

01:21:44.303 --> 01:21:45.345
Good idea!

01:21:45.511 --> 01:21:47.720
So, tonight we'll have a pizza party!

01:21:51.136 --> 01:21:52.345
Light?

01:21:52.761 --> 01:21:53.761
I will do something.

01:21:53.886 --> 01:21:55.677
There will be a lantern.

01:21:55.678 --> 01:21:56.594
Where?

01:21:56.595 --> 01:21:57.552
There...

01:21:57.553 --> 01:21:58.720
Okay.

01:22:07.761 --> 01:22:10.720
Sir, good the power went off.

01:22:12.011 --> 01:22:13.761
We could have a candlelight dinner.

01:22:14.011 --> 01:22:15.386
No. No.

01:22:16.011 --> 01:22:17.886
It's a lantern light pizza.

01:22:18.011 --> 01:22:19.136
[laughs]

01:22:19.386 --> 01:22:20.761
Are you enjoying?

01:22:21.761 --> 01:22:23.011
Eat. Eat.

01:22:24.636 --> 01:22:25.761
Wait a second.

01:22:25.970 --> 01:22:27.261
Take this slice.

01:22:27.761 --> 01:22:29.761
It's loaded with cheese.

01:22:30.136 --> 01:22:32.636
This is cheese burst pizza.

01:22:34.011 --> 01:22:35.761
What the hell!

01:22:36.636 --> 01:22:38.511
My god! I was right!

01:22:39.595 --> 01:22:41.595
Hey, Pandey,
you came in with the electricity.

01:22:50.511 --> 01:22:51.761
- Helen! Helen! Take this.
- Yes.

01:22:52.386 --> 01:22:53.470
Thank you.

01:22:56.386 --> 01:22:57.470
What!?

01:22:58.136 --> 01:22:59.261
Enjoy your pizza.

01:22:59.636 --> 01:23:00.760
It's your age to enjoy pizza.

01:23:00.761 --> 01:23:02.635
It's not like that, Mr. Pandey.
Actually...

01:23:02.636 --> 01:23:04.470
No, I understand.

01:23:05.136 --> 01:23:08.761
These days, schools give
children extracurricular activities

01:23:09.095 --> 01:23:11.470
alongside their studies, Mr. Dubey.

01:23:12.011 --> 01:23:15.345
And this pizza business is also extracurricular
activity that you're doing.

01:23:15.720 --> 01:23:17.094
Keep it extra only.

01:23:17.095 --> 01:23:20.345
Don't add it up to the main course.
Otherwise, there will be a problem.

01:23:20.761 --> 01:23:22.386
You've got it all wrong, Mr. Pandey.

01:23:22.595 --> 01:23:24.510
Actually, Manu and I are just...

01:23:24.511 --> 01:23:26.720
Manu? Who's she?

01:23:27.011 --> 01:23:29.136
Oh! You don't know.

01:23:29.511 --> 01:23:31.386
She's not Helen.

01:23:31.511 --> 01:23:34.344
She's Manu Joshi, from Uttarakhand.

01:23:34.345 --> 01:23:35.844
She's from a Royal Garage family.

01:23:35.845 --> 01:23:36.885
From a royal family?

01:23:36.886 --> 01:23:39.969
No. Royal Garage.
It's owned by her father.

01:23:39.970 --> 01:23:43.595
She's from that family.
The poor girl went to Delhi...

01:23:58.720 --> 01:23:59.677
She's Manu.

01:23:59.678 --> 01:24:00.886
- Manu Joshi.
- And you?

01:24:01.011 --> 01:24:01.970
Ranjan!

01:24:02.136 --> 01:24:03.761
So, now we'll have some
Manu-Ranjan (entertainment)!

01:24:03.886 --> 01:24:05.095
My goodness!

01:24:06.845 --> 01:24:07.970
You know,

01:24:08.886 --> 01:24:10.511
these people operate in entire gangs.

01:24:11.345 --> 01:24:13.511
- What is the chronology?
- What?

01:24:14.011 --> 01:24:16.595
They come in gang.

01:24:17.011 --> 01:24:19.636
They trap you with their beauty.

01:24:19.761 --> 01:24:23.886
In a few days,
you'll be saying you're in love with her.

01:24:24.011 --> 01:24:26.885
Nobody trapped anybody!
Pandey, you're overthinking...

01:24:26.886 --> 01:24:28.677
That's exactly what being trapped means.

01:24:28.678 --> 01:24:31.595
You're arguing with me on this.
That means you're trapped.

01:24:31.761 --> 01:24:33.261
You don't know the truth.

01:24:34.720 --> 01:24:36.761
I'm telling you,
she's part of a bride-robbery-gang!

01:24:37.720 --> 01:24:39.345
Bride-robbery-gang.

01:24:40.011 --> 01:24:41.136
Understand?

01:24:41.261 --> 01:24:43.635
Yes, I understood.
Your mind is corrupt.

01:24:43.636 --> 01:24:47.345
It's just cooking up the stories.
You better leave. Go.

01:24:48.636 --> 01:24:50.469
- Okay, I am leaving.
- Get lost.

01:24:50.470 --> 01:24:52.970
You will regret. Mark my words.

01:25:03.470 --> 01:25:06.010
Listen. There's a sale.
I need to check out a few things.

01:25:06.011 --> 01:25:08.385
Sure, you look around.
I'll rest for a bit.

01:25:08.386 --> 01:25:09.344
Stay here.

01:25:09.345 --> 01:25:11.719
Yes, you've been looking around
since morning and haven't bought anything.

01:25:11.720 --> 01:25:12.970
You're just making tall claims.

01:25:13.845 --> 01:25:16.011
Start this machine for half an hour.

01:25:39.011 --> 01:25:42.511
Hey! Stop this machine. I will be back.

01:25:55.761 --> 01:25:57.011
Hello!

01:25:57.761 --> 01:25:59.470
Thank you, please.

01:26:07.720 --> 01:26:09.636
Hello, sir. Ticket!

01:26:11.095 --> 01:26:12.719
- I've to show you ticket?
- Yes, sir.

01:26:12.720 --> 01:26:14.636
Okay. I will...

01:26:15.595 --> 01:26:17.136
Sir, which screen?

01:26:17.636 --> 01:26:18.761
Fourth!

01:26:38.720 --> 01:26:41.136
How long has Dubey's family
been waiting for him?

01:26:41.386 --> 01:26:43.011
It's been a long time.

01:26:47.720 --> 01:26:50.345
Hey! He's back.

01:26:50.636 --> 01:26:51.677
Both of them are coming.

01:26:51.678 --> 01:26:52.761
There they are.

01:26:56.095 --> 01:26:58.761
- I started crying watching the mother cry.
- [laughs]

01:26:58.886 --> 01:26:59.761
Yes.

01:26:59.886 --> 01:27:01.636
Hey! What are these people doing here?

01:27:02.970 --> 01:27:04.136
Look. Look.

01:27:04.511 --> 01:27:08.136
The moment she saw everyone,
that con woman backed off!

01:27:13.595 --> 01:27:14.761
Get closer.

01:27:15.136 --> 01:27:16.720
What else is left to do now?

01:27:17.011 --> 01:27:17.845
Got caught.

01:27:18.095 --> 01:27:19.845
You probably didn't even watch
the movie in the cinema hall.

01:27:20.011 --> 01:27:21.761
You must have been busy doing all that.

01:27:31.261 --> 01:27:33.970
Brother Mintu, what's going on here?

01:27:38.636 --> 01:27:40.886
You all wanted me to get married,
didn't you?

01:27:42.511 --> 01:27:44.386
I'm ready to get married...

01:27:45.720 --> 01:27:46.761
to Helen!

01:27:52.636 --> 01:27:53.761
Helen,

01:27:54.136 --> 01:27:57.386
I don't know when I
developed feelings for you.

01:27:59.511 --> 01:28:01.011
I'm sorry.

01:28:01.386 --> 01:28:04.595
I'm confessing my love here,
in front of everyone, like this.

01:28:07.011 --> 01:28:08.761
You can say 'no' if you want.

01:28:08.886 --> 01:28:10.886
I won't hold it against you.

01:28:12.511 --> 01:28:16.761
Yes, it'll hurt a little,

01:28:18.095 --> 01:28:21.595
but your consent matters
just as much to me.

01:28:23.845 --> 01:28:25.761
Even if you refuse,

01:28:26.386 --> 01:28:31.761
I will give you six months' salary
before sending you back respectfully.

01:28:37.136 --> 01:28:39.720
Mintu!
What nonsense are you talking?

01:28:40.886 --> 01:28:43.385
Has she cast some spell on you?

01:28:43.386 --> 01:28:44.470
Yes, sister.

01:28:45.886 --> 01:28:47.386
She has done some spell.

01:28:47.720 --> 01:28:48.761
You know what?

01:28:48.886 --> 01:28:50.511
Ever since she has come here,

01:28:51.636 --> 01:28:54.011
the house has become lively. So am I.

01:28:55.845 --> 01:28:58.886
And you think she's a housekeeper.

01:28:59.636 --> 01:29:01.095
But that's not her truth.

01:29:01.595 --> 01:29:02.761
She's not Helen.

01:29:02.970 --> 01:29:04.385
She's Manu Joshi!

01:29:04.386 --> 01:29:06.470
She comes from a respectable family.

01:29:06.720 --> 01:29:07.720
Chaurasiya. - Yes.

01:29:08.511 --> 01:29:10.345
Mr. Dubey is caught red handed.

01:29:10.761 --> 01:29:12.261
He deserves punishment.

01:29:13.095 --> 01:29:14.844
First she fled from her house.

01:29:14.845 --> 01:29:16.719
Then she fled from some other place.

01:29:16.720 --> 01:29:18.095
And came here.

01:29:18.470 --> 01:29:20.136
Now, she has trapped you.

01:29:20.511 --> 01:29:21.261
And you...

01:29:21.386 --> 01:29:24.511
fell for just any random
girl you came across?

01:29:24.886 --> 01:29:27.011
You're busy with her day and night,

01:29:27.136 --> 01:29:29.760
doing all sorts of indecent things
and ruining Dad's reputation.

01:29:29.761 --> 01:29:32.677
Sister, I haven't done anything that could
bring shame to the family.

01:29:32.678 --> 01:29:36.345
I've been telling you to find a nice girl
and get him married.

01:29:36.636 --> 01:29:38.760
I even asked about
my sister-in-law's sister for you!

01:29:38.761 --> 01:29:39.760
Keep quiet!

01:29:39.761 --> 01:29:42.261
He just wants to bring us shame.

01:29:42.636 --> 01:29:44.011
Sister, please.

01:29:44.595 --> 01:29:46.886
You can say whatever you want to me.

01:29:47.386 --> 01:29:49.095
Your brother is exactly
the same person he was before.

01:29:49.261 --> 01:29:52.720
And we haven't done anything that
could bring shame to your family.

01:29:53.011 --> 01:29:55.595
If he had been anyone else,

01:29:55.720 --> 01:29:58.011
I might have run away from here, too.

01:29:58.386 --> 01:30:04.011
Even though we live under the same roof,

01:30:04.386 --> 01:30:07.720
he always made me feel safe.

01:30:08.345 --> 01:30:11.761
He treated me like a family member
and gave me respect.

01:30:13.011 --> 01:30:18.136
We women can easily
tell how a man looks at us,

01:30:18.261 --> 01:30:20.011
whether his intentions are good or bad.

01:30:21.095 --> 01:30:25.595
Your brother is nothing
but a kind-hearted gentleman.

01:30:25.720 --> 01:30:26.761
Stop!

01:30:27.761 --> 01:30:29.677
We are discussing a family matter.

01:30:29.678 --> 01:30:30.886
Don't interrupt.

01:30:31.136 --> 01:30:33.761
We know he's a gentleman.

01:30:34.011 --> 01:30:35.635
That's exactly what
you're taking advantage of.

01:30:35.636 --> 01:30:37.136
Shut up, Babli.

01:30:38.345 --> 01:30:40.595
I've had it with all
your lectures, sister.

01:30:41.636 --> 01:30:43.636
She won't keep quiet.
What's your problem?

01:30:43.761 --> 01:30:45.886
If you've a problem,
get up and leave right now

01:30:46.136 --> 01:30:48.970
before I say something in my fury.

01:30:49.136 --> 01:30:50.845
Later, I won't be able to take back.

01:30:51.761 --> 01:30:53.095
How can we just leave?

01:30:53.345 --> 01:30:54.761
We were also born here.

01:30:55.011 --> 01:30:57.511
This house belongs to us
just as much as it belongs to you.

01:30:57.636 --> 01:30:59.136
Don't try to intimidate us, brother.

01:30:59.386 --> 01:31:02.011
You're the one disgracing
the family, not us!

01:31:10.553 --> 01:31:11.470
You...

01:31:26.095 --> 01:31:27.136
Hey!

01:31:30.011 --> 01:31:31.344
Where is the car going?

01:31:31.345 --> 01:31:32.511
It doesn't look like a local.

01:31:46.511 --> 01:31:57.011
<i>♪ When I wrote your name and erased it,
I missed you. ♪</i>

01:31:59.261 --> 01:32:09.970
<i>♪ When I wrote your name and erased it,
I missed you. ♪</i>

01:32:11.386 --> 01:32:22.761
<i>♪ When I embraced your photo, ♪</i>

01:32:23.011 --> 01:32:28.886
<i>♪ I missed you. ♪</i>

01:32:30.761 --> 01:32:37.010
<i>♪ When I saw the moon hidden behind
the clouds, ♪</i>

01:32:37.011 --> 01:32:41.845
<i>♪ I missed you. ♪</i>

01:33:05.261 --> 01:33:07.095
Where's that con bride going?

01:33:13.636 --> 01:33:16.136
Hey! They are from her gang.

01:33:17.261 --> 01:33:19.386
She ran off with her gang.

01:33:19.595 --> 01:33:21.011
Did you see that, Chaurasiya?

01:33:21.386 --> 01:33:24.261
Mr. Pandey, when will you speak then?
Go and inform Dubey.

01:33:24.386 --> 01:33:25.386
Yes.

01:33:25.761 --> 01:33:27.595
Gone with the wind.

01:33:29.178 --> 01:33:30.052
[knocks]

01:33:30.053 --> 01:33:31.261
Hey, Mr. Dubey!

01:33:31.720 --> 01:33:33.011
Open the door!

01:33:33.595 --> 01:33:35.969
Didn't I tell you she was a con bride?

01:33:35.970 --> 01:33:37.136
She will run away.

01:33:37.345 --> 01:33:38.636
She ran off with her gang.

01:33:38.845 --> 01:33:39.761
Who?

01:33:40.136 --> 01:33:41.010
Helen?

01:33:41.011 --> 01:33:42.594
- Yes, Helen.
- Really?

01:33:42.595 --> 01:33:43.761
Yes, of course.

01:33:43.886 --> 01:33:45.469
That's how these girls operate.

01:33:45.470 --> 01:33:48.136
They trap the boys first.

01:33:48.511 --> 01:33:51.511
And then, they just disappear
with their gang.

01:33:51.636 --> 01:33:52.761
Gone forever.

01:34:01.345 --> 01:34:03.345
- Is anything missing from the house?
- No.

01:34:04.011 --> 01:34:06.719
Are you related to the missing girl?

01:34:06.720 --> 01:34:08.136
No, not at all.

01:34:12.345 --> 01:34:14.720
Then what are you here to report?

01:34:14.886 --> 01:34:16.761
She probably left of her own free will.

01:34:16.970 --> 01:34:19.761
Madam, she did leave,
but not of her own free will.

01:34:20.095 --> 01:34:21.469
She might be in danger.

01:34:21.470 --> 01:34:24.136
Absconding. She ran away by a car.

01:34:24.345 --> 01:34:26.011
- She is gone.
- I saw.

01:34:26.136 --> 01:34:27.511
- She didn't just leave.
- She ran away!

01:34:27.636 --> 01:34:29.095
Did she leave or run away?

01:34:29.345 --> 01:34:32.970
At least get your own stories straight
before coming to file a complaint.

01:34:33.136 --> 01:34:35.011
Register an FIR.

01:34:35.720 --> 01:34:38.635
I've contacts with the higher authorities.

01:34:38.636 --> 01:34:39.761
I will go to them.

01:34:42.261 --> 01:34:43.719
Stop creating scene over here. Get out!

01:34:43.720 --> 01:34:45.136
- Okay, we are going.
- Don't waste our time.

01:34:45.261 --> 01:34:46.761
- Okay, we are going.
- Go.

01:34:47.470 --> 01:34:49.595
Don't push. Don't...

01:34:51.970 --> 01:34:52.970
Come here.

01:34:53.761 --> 01:34:54.511
Yes.

01:34:54.636 --> 01:34:56.095
I will talk like this.
Understand yourself.

01:34:56.220 --> 01:34:56.760
Okay.

01:34:56.761 --> 01:34:58.636
And don't give my name to anyone.

01:34:59.136 --> 01:35:02.095
That Haryana gang has been
in Lucknow since yesterday.

01:35:02.761 --> 01:35:04.886
Madam herself gave
them your home address.

01:35:05.720 --> 01:35:07.845
Those people must have
abducted the girl.

01:35:08.636 --> 01:35:10.845
Then why aren't you doing anything?

01:35:11.011 --> 01:35:12.886
Come on. The matter has been arranged
at a higher level.

01:35:13.345 --> 01:35:15.011
The gang has considerable
political influence.

01:35:15.511 --> 01:35:16.720
There's nothing we can do.

01:35:17.136 --> 01:35:18.260
Since you're a decent man,

01:35:18.261 --> 01:35:20.511
I am passing on the information
and helping you.

01:35:22.636 --> 01:35:25.720
Any idea where they might have taken her?

01:35:26.470 --> 01:35:29.636
I heard them saying they won't take
any chances this time.

01:35:29.761 --> 01:35:32.136
So, they'd get her married here
and then take her to Delhi or Haryana.

01:35:35.761 --> 01:35:38.011
- Come here.
- Yeah... please.

01:35:38.178 --> 01:35:39.677
- Yes, ma'am.
- They suspect her character.

01:35:39.678 --> 01:35:42.385
Why don't you tell
them what a cunning girl she is?

01:35:42.386 --> 01:35:43.261
No, no!

01:35:43.845 --> 01:35:45.636
She's a good girl from
a respectable family.

01:35:45.886 --> 01:35:48.011
The poor thing got caught up
in a human trafficking racket.

01:35:48.345 --> 01:35:50.386
They've abducted her
to force her into marriage.

01:35:51.970 --> 01:35:53.844
Listen, I'll inform you as soon as
I've any information.

01:35:53.845 --> 01:35:54.761
- Keep your phone switched on.
- Yes.

01:35:54.886 --> 01:35:55.761
Give me way.

01:35:56.636 --> 01:35:57.761
Are you satisfied?

01:36:03.720 --> 01:36:04.511
Brother!

01:36:05.095 --> 01:36:05.886
No.

01:36:06.970 --> 01:36:08.761
Take it back. Serve them.

01:36:09.761 --> 01:36:11.761
They're happy now that they've
driven her out of the house.

01:36:13.386 --> 01:36:15.011
Wonder what condition that poor girl
is in right now.

01:36:42.720 --> 01:36:43.511
Mr. Dubey.

01:36:45.345 --> 01:36:46.345
Forgive us.

01:36:47.636 --> 01:36:48.761
We made a mistake.

01:36:50.720 --> 01:36:51.511
By God!

01:36:53.095 --> 01:36:56.011
You're the wisest among us.

01:36:57.761 --> 01:36:59.636
We're all fools.

01:37:02.720 --> 01:37:03.511
But...

01:37:04.761 --> 01:37:06.761
we're still your family.

01:37:07.845 --> 01:37:09.136
Forgive us, buddy.

01:37:10.511 --> 01:37:11.636
Please, Mr. Dubey.

01:37:13.011 --> 01:37:14.011
Mintu!

01:37:15.761 --> 01:37:19.011
We made a terrible mistake
in judging her character.

01:37:21.886 --> 01:37:22.886
Brother,

01:37:23.761 --> 01:37:27.261
as long as we get our sister-in-law back,
we don't need anything else.

01:37:27.386 --> 01:37:28.011
Yes.

01:37:28.636 --> 01:37:31.095
We'll definitely find her.

01:37:31.761 --> 01:37:34.219
Brother Mintu has fallen
in love for the first time.

01:37:34.220 --> 01:37:35.220
Yes.

01:37:35.470 --> 01:37:37.385
It may take time,
but justice will prevail.

01:37:37.386 --> 01:37:38.886
- Yes.
- Right, Mintu?

01:37:39.136 --> 01:37:40.385
- We will find her.
- Yes.

01:37:40.386 --> 01:37:41.636
Brother, we will find her.

01:37:41.761 --> 01:37:43.136
We will find her

01:37:45.011 --> 01:37:45.970
Mr. Dubey.

01:37:46.511 --> 01:37:47.761
Please don't be so harsh.

01:37:48.886 --> 01:37:49.845
Hello!

01:37:52.845 --> 01:37:54.095
Rajaram!

01:37:54.261 --> 01:37:55.928
[sobs]

01:37:58.720 --> 01:38:00.760
Love is very powerful.

01:38:00.761 --> 01:38:03.927
Just look at how it turned our Mr.
Ranjan into Manoranjan(entertainment)!

01:38:03.928 --> 01:38:04.344
[phone rings]

01:38:04.345 --> 01:38:07.261
My parents got me married
when I was in college.

01:38:07.470 --> 01:38:09.136
Get away, don't spoil my video.

01:38:09.261 --> 01:38:10.510
So, after marriage...

01:38:10.511 --> 01:38:12.761
Sister-in-law Tamanna.
Stop the marriage. I've got a call.

01:38:12.886 --> 01:38:13.886
- Hold on!
- Hello.

01:38:15.095 --> 01:38:15.761
Yes.

01:38:16.095 --> 01:38:16.761
Okay.

01:38:17.511 --> 01:38:18.136
Okay.

01:38:18.845 --> 01:38:19.885
- What happened?
- Where are you off to?

01:38:19.886 --> 01:38:21.011
- What happened?
- Mintu!

01:38:21.345 --> 01:38:23.511
I've spent enough time being a Beta.

01:38:23.970 --> 01:38:25.761
It's time to become an Alpha!

01:38:26.261 --> 01:38:27.760
We're going in for a mass attack.

01:38:27.761 --> 01:38:28.885
Come on, everyone!

01:38:28.886 --> 01:38:30.719
Operation search!

01:38:30.720 --> 01:38:32.135
- Follow me.
- Let's go.

01:38:32.136 --> 01:38:34.720
- We will do it.
- Found sister-in-law!

01:38:35.386 --> 01:38:37.677
Guys, we've to reunite
two people in love.

01:38:37.678 --> 01:38:38.845
Stay with us live.

01:38:39.095 --> 01:38:41.511
Yes, send me. I'm on my way.

01:38:42.511 --> 01:38:45.386
Hey, come with me.

01:38:45.761 --> 01:38:47.761
Where are we going?

01:38:49.011 --> 01:38:51.261
Come here.

01:39:02.636 --> 01:39:03.720
Let's go.

01:39:07.803 --> 01:39:09.761
[upbeat music]

01:39:15.511 --> 01:39:16.595
What's happening?

01:39:17.761 --> 01:39:19.136
You're talking about Alpha, Beta, Gamma.

01:39:19.345 --> 01:39:20.635
And have become Vasco-da-Gama.

01:39:20.636 --> 01:39:21.969
But don't know where we are heading.

01:39:21.970 --> 01:39:23.385
Didn't even get a location yet.

01:39:23.386 --> 01:39:25.470
Keep checking.
You will get the location.

01:39:28.761 --> 01:39:30.636
- Yes, I got it.
- Got it?

01:39:30.886 --> 01:39:32.094
Send it to everyone. Now.

01:39:32.095 --> 01:39:34.720
- Where?
- To the office group.

01:39:35.011 --> 01:39:36.511
Location is correct.

01:39:38.261 --> 01:39:39.595
Come fast.

01:39:39.886 --> 01:39:40.677
Yeah.

01:39:40.678 --> 01:39:41.761
Oh, hello!

01:39:41.886 --> 01:39:42.761
Where are you going?

01:39:42.886 --> 01:39:44.969
We're from the electricity department.
We've come to take the meter reading.

01:39:44.970 --> 01:39:48.011
You can't go in right now.
There's VIP movement inside.

01:39:48.136 --> 01:39:50.511
Get away. Let's go to the meter room.

01:39:50.636 --> 01:39:51.844
- Hey, excuse me.
- We're government employees.

01:39:51.845 --> 01:39:53.761
We can go anywhere, anytime. Come.

01:39:57.136 --> 01:39:58.511
Tell her to get ready.

01:39:59.136 --> 01:40:00.761
How much longer do we have to wait?

01:40:01.636 --> 01:40:02.595
Go.

01:40:08.345 --> 01:40:11.511
No matter what you do, I won't marry him!

01:40:12.595 --> 01:40:15.761
My time is bad.

01:40:16.011 --> 01:40:18.136
I said you can't go inside. Stop.

01:40:18.261 --> 01:40:19.719
This is trespassing.

01:40:19.720 --> 01:40:21.720
Hey! Didn't I tell
you not to let anyone in?

01:40:22.011 --> 01:40:23.344
Who have you brought inside?

01:40:23.345 --> 01:40:24.427
Meter reading, as they say.

01:40:24.428 --> 01:40:25.677
They say they're here
for the meter reading.

01:40:25.678 --> 01:40:26.720
Sir!

01:40:27.136 --> 01:40:28.261
Are you alright?

01:40:31.386 --> 01:40:32.470
What is going on here?

01:40:32.761 --> 01:40:34.636
The meter reading was just an excuse.

01:40:34.970 --> 01:40:37.386
Actually, we came to have
a one-on-one conversation with you.

01:40:37.511 --> 01:40:38.136
So, you two are frauds?

01:40:38.345 --> 01:40:40.011
You're the one committing fraud here

01:40:40.511 --> 01:40:43.469
by forcing her to marry
you against her will.

01:40:43.470 --> 01:40:45.761
Hey! I'm not here to
listen to your lecture.

01:40:46.595 --> 01:40:47.511
Who are you?

01:40:47.636 --> 01:40:52.760
I'm someone whose own home forced
an educated girl to live as a maid,

01:40:52.761 --> 01:40:54.761
all because of people
like you and your actions.

01:40:54.886 --> 01:40:56.845
Devendra! Have these two thrown out!

01:40:57.011 --> 01:40:58.595
Hey! Nobody will come near me,

01:40:58.761 --> 01:41:00.386
- or I'll explode!
- Why?

01:41:00.886 --> 01:41:02.011
Have you strapped a bomb to yourself?

01:41:02.386 --> 01:41:04.386
I've been fuming with anger since morning.

01:41:05.845 --> 01:41:07.677
If anyone comes near me,
I'll turn into a revolutionary!

01:41:07.678 --> 01:41:08.635
I'm warning you!

01:41:08.636 --> 01:41:10.011
Shoot them!

01:41:11.511 --> 01:41:13.095
Who's going to shoot me? You?

01:41:13.511 --> 01:41:14.386
Devendra?

01:41:14.886 --> 01:41:15.845
Or you?

01:41:16.386 --> 01:41:18.470
Here's an idea.
Why don't you shoot me yourself?

01:41:18.761 --> 01:41:20.386
It's easy for you.

01:41:20.595 --> 01:41:22.844
The way you're planning
to force her into marriage today,

01:41:22.845 --> 01:41:24.261
shooting someone must seem
like a very easy thing to do, right?

01:41:24.386 --> 01:41:24.886
So, go on.

01:41:25.136 --> 01:41:26.511
I've come here prepared to die today.

01:41:28.386 --> 01:41:29.511
But remember,

01:41:29.720 --> 01:41:31.636
you won't escape unscathed either.

01:41:32.386 --> 01:41:36.095
Soon, a whole army of well-wishers will
arrive to rescue Manu.

01:41:36.886 --> 01:41:39.886
Shoot as many as you can!
How many more people will you kill?

01:41:40.636 --> 01:41:42.344
And listen, if you shoot,

01:41:42.345 --> 01:41:44.886
- my elder brother will step in!
- Hey! Hey!

01:41:45.761 --> 01:41:47.095
- Are you not my elder brother?
- Yes, I am.

01:41:47.720 --> 01:41:48.261
So?

01:41:48.470 --> 01:41:49.095
Excuse me, sir.

01:41:49.511 --> 01:41:50.886
Picking a fight with women

01:41:52.261 --> 01:41:53.720
can be dangerous for your health.

01:41:54.761 --> 01:41:56.886
You might end up finding your body parts
in a blue drum at home.

01:41:58.511 --> 01:41:59.136
Yes, I'm right.

01:41:59.386 --> 01:42:00.761
That's quite popular news these days.

01:42:01.136 --> 01:42:03.845
Wife killing her husband
with the help of her love interest.

01:42:05.970 --> 01:42:07.136
And then, chopping him
into a lot of pieces.

01:42:07.386 --> 01:42:09.677
I'm serious and you're
giving the breaking news.

01:42:09.678 --> 01:42:11.636
- This is very serious!
- Have you two finished your nonsense?

01:42:11.845 --> 01:42:14.011
Now, just shut up before
I actually shoot you!

01:42:14.470 --> 01:42:16.511
You started again?

01:42:16.636 --> 01:42:18.511
Do you know your problem?

01:42:19.511 --> 01:42:20.886
You have only two sons.

01:42:21.261 --> 01:42:23.970
If you had a daughter of her age,

01:42:24.636 --> 01:42:26.511
you would have never
done something like this.

01:42:27.636 --> 01:42:30.261
I know because I have
three sisters. I know.

01:42:31.136 --> 01:42:32.970
I can also understand your plight.

01:42:33.261 --> 01:42:35.886
After your wife's death,
you must have become lonely.

01:42:36.011 --> 01:42:38.344
Maybe, you're feeling
the need for a companion.

01:42:38.345 --> 01:42:38.760
Yeah.

01:42:38.761 --> 01:42:40.761
So, you tried to buy one with your money.

01:42:41.345 --> 01:42:44.011
That con deceived her
in the name of interview.

01:42:44.345 --> 01:42:46.511
Actually, both of you were deceived.

01:42:46.845 --> 01:42:50.011
But you're punishing her alone.

01:42:50.886 --> 01:42:52.761
Why didn't you file a
police complaint back then?

01:42:53.345 --> 01:42:54.511
Because you were afraid
of being humiliated, right?

01:42:54.720 --> 01:42:57.845
But what you're about to do
now won't earn you any respect either.

01:42:58.511 --> 01:43:00.261
If all you want is companionship,

01:43:00.386 --> 01:43:03.761
why not marry a helpless
widow of your own age?

01:43:04.011 --> 01:43:05.386
With due respect.

01:43:05.595 --> 01:43:08.386
At least then, people would praise you
and you'd earn respect in society.

01:43:08.761 --> 01:43:11.011
You could rise from a small-time
politician to a big-league leader.

01:43:11.261 --> 01:43:12.386
But what are you doing?

01:43:13.095 --> 01:43:14.969
Three members of this
family and four goons

01:43:14.970 --> 01:43:17.136
are hiding out at a farmhouse,
holding a wedding at gunpoint.

01:43:17.345 --> 01:43:18.011
Why?

01:43:18.636 --> 01:43:20.261
Because you know

01:43:21.261 --> 01:43:23.011
what you're doing is immoral.

01:43:26.095 --> 01:43:27.386
What do you want?

01:43:27.720 --> 01:43:28.511
Nothing.

01:43:28.761 --> 01:43:31.760
I'm just here to make
you face your conscience.

01:43:31.761 --> 01:43:33.970
What?

01:43:34.136 --> 01:43:36.845
No. Ask your children.

01:43:37.261 --> 01:43:39.510
Are they happy with what you're doing?

01:43:39.511 --> 01:43:41.386
Or are they standing
by you out of helplessness?

01:43:41.636 --> 01:43:45.845
Why drag these poor children
into your wrongdoing?

01:43:48.095 --> 01:43:49.636
Look at your daughter-in-law.

01:43:57.470 --> 01:43:59.720
I was the one

01:44:02.970 --> 01:44:04.720
who helped her escape that night.

01:44:14.761 --> 01:44:16.011
She's telling the truth, Dad.

01:44:17.761 --> 01:44:19.761
At first, I was also very angry.

01:44:20.970 --> 01:44:24.470
But then I realised,
she did the right thing.

01:44:25.511 --> 01:44:26.386
The right thing?

01:44:29.261 --> 01:44:32.470
You think it's right to
ruin your father's reputation?

01:44:32.845 --> 01:44:33.886
Yes, Dad.

01:44:34.095 --> 01:44:35.345
Because you're wrong.

01:44:35.470 --> 01:44:37.261
Even if I was wrong,

01:44:38.511 --> 01:44:40.636
did it have to take an outsider
to point it out to me?

01:44:42.511 --> 01:44:43.886
Couldn't you have told me?

01:44:44.761 --> 01:44:46.261
I wanted to, Dad.

01:44:47.011 --> 01:44:48.386
But I never dared to,

01:44:49.011 --> 01:44:51.636
out of respect for
you and fear of your anger.

01:44:54.386 --> 01:44:56.720
Where's our army? It's still not here.

01:44:57.261 --> 01:44:58.761
I'm also waiting.

01:44:59.011 --> 01:45:00.720
It seems they're stuck up in traffic.

01:45:01.386 --> 01:45:03.011
Manu! Come here.

01:45:03.636 --> 01:45:04.720
Yes.

01:45:08.345 --> 01:45:09.803
- Sir.
- Hmm.

01:45:09.970 --> 01:45:12.386
What a speech!

01:45:13.303 --> 01:45:14.553
[chuckles]

01:45:15.511 --> 01:45:16.511
Mr. Dubey,

01:45:17.720 --> 01:45:20.595
you set out from home like
a steam engine to become an Alpha.

01:45:21.886 --> 01:45:24.011
But you settled the whole
matter just by talking!

01:45:24.595 --> 01:45:25.760
When will you give few punches?

01:45:25.761 --> 01:45:30.511
Sir, being an Alpha isn't just
about throwing punches or beating up.

01:45:31.345 --> 01:45:33.136
An Alpha leads with his heart.

01:45:33.511 --> 01:45:35.470
Their thinking is refined.

01:45:35.636 --> 01:45:36.511
Great!

01:45:36.761 --> 01:45:39.386
- What a knowledge!
- Sir!

01:45:39.636 --> 01:45:42.094
Mintu, we're here!
We'll smash every single one of them!

01:45:42.095 --> 01:45:45.260
- Attack! Surround them!
- Hey! No... no...

01:45:45.261 --> 01:45:47.178
Hey, stop! Calm down, everyone.

01:45:47.386 --> 01:45:50.261
They are on talking terms.
We've almost reached a compromise.

01:45:50.386 --> 01:45:52.345
- See. She's with us.
- Yes.

01:45:52.595 --> 01:45:54.720
He's talking.

01:45:55.386 --> 01:45:56.136
Cool!

01:46:15.511 --> 01:46:16.970
Is this your army?

01:46:21.011 --> 01:46:23.011
Bullets would've been wasted on them.

01:46:25.136 --> 01:46:26.761
One puff of air would've
blown them all away!

01:46:37.386 --> 01:46:38.761
I made a mistake.

01:46:41.595 --> 01:46:45.761
Actually, ego got in the
way over those ten lakh rupees.

01:46:47.886 --> 01:46:49.511
Money can be earned again.

01:46:51.636 --> 01:46:53.511
But lost respect isn't regained easily.

01:46:56.386 --> 01:46:57.761
I will correct my mistake.

01:47:00.011 --> 01:47:04.470
But I won't spare that Kailash.

01:47:04.845 --> 01:47:06.886
Sir, thank you.

01:47:07.595 --> 01:47:09.220
[chuckles]

01:47:10.761 --> 01:47:11.761
Down!

01:47:13.720 --> 01:47:14.761
Take the gun down!

01:47:17.720 --> 01:47:20.845
Mr. Singh, everyone makes mistakes.

01:47:21.095 --> 01:47:24.720
But the one who accepts his mistake
is always great. Like you.

01:47:25.011 --> 01:47:27.095
I told you I have three sisters.

01:47:28.095 --> 01:47:30.344
There they are. Come... come here.

01:47:30.345 --> 01:47:31.760
- He is my eldest brother-in-law.
- Mr. Pandey.

01:47:31.761 --> 01:47:33.344
- The other two brothers-in-law are behind him.
- Mr. Pandey.

01:47:33.345 --> 01:47:34.760
These are my three sisters.

01:47:34.761 --> 01:47:36.011
And they are my office colleagues.

01:47:36.136 --> 01:47:38.761
- Sir, I'm Ghanshyam, his friend.
- And I'm Chaurasiya.

01:47:40.845 --> 01:47:41.720
Come.

01:47:42.761 --> 01:47:45.010
Sorry, Manu,
I said so many hurtful things to you...

01:47:45.011 --> 01:47:46.636
Sister, it's okay.

01:47:46.761 --> 01:47:48.761
You didn't know the truth about me either.

01:47:50.845 --> 01:47:52.845
This is my elder son, Devendra.

01:47:54.011 --> 01:47:54.886
Surendra.

01:47:55.011 --> 01:47:57.095
And this is my daughter-in-law. Dimpy.

01:47:58.345 --> 01:48:00.886
- She had helped me flee.
- Is it?

01:48:01.011 --> 01:48:02.136
Yes, first time.

01:48:06.886 --> 01:48:07.886
- Devendra.
- Yes.

01:48:08.136 --> 01:48:09.761
- Have all the luggage loaded into the car.
- Yes.

01:48:10.511 --> 01:48:12.636
That calls for a group photo!
Excuse me, sir.

01:48:13.345 --> 01:48:15.761
Mrs. Tamanna wants a family photo.

01:48:15.886 --> 01:48:17.719
- A group photo.
- That's wonderful!

01:48:17.720 --> 01:48:19.885
- Please, come.
- Come join us. Yes, come, son.

01:48:19.886 --> 01:48:22.469
- You also come.
- Yes, please. Come here.

01:48:22.470 --> 01:48:23.635
- Please, please...
- Yes.

01:48:23.636 --> 01:48:25.719
The tall ones should lean down a bit.

01:48:25.720 --> 01:48:27.136
- Son, come in the frame.
- Yes.

01:48:28.386 --> 01:48:30.595
Is Ms. Chetna a widow?

01:48:31.386 --> 01:48:32.470
Consciousness.

01:48:33.095 --> 01:48:34.011
My wife.

01:48:36.470 --> 01:48:37.470
Smile, please.

01:48:39.345 --> 01:48:40.511
Smile!

01:48:58.636 --> 01:49:00.095
An admission letter?!

01:49:01.761 --> 01:49:05.720
Air Hostess Training Academy,
Lucknow branch!

01:49:06.345 --> 01:49:07.345
Yes.

01:49:07.636 --> 01:49:10.761
It's a 100% placement guarantee!

01:49:11.595 --> 01:49:15.511
So you won't have
to run away a third time.

01:49:15.761 --> 01:49:17.636
What do you think, Mr. Dubey?

01:49:17.761 --> 01:49:19.720
That I'd run away from Lucknow?

01:49:22.761 --> 01:49:25.761
I'm not going anywhere from here.
Not now, not ever!

01:49:26.095 --> 01:49:26.927
Never?

01:49:26.928 --> 01:49:28.220
[chuckles]

01:49:29.470 --> 01:49:31.011
If you won't go from here,

01:49:31.136 --> 01:49:33.970
how will my dream to
go to the mountains come true?

01:49:34.136 --> 01:49:35.886
I will take you there.

01:49:36.761 --> 01:49:40.761
And we get discounts in airlines.

01:49:41.470 --> 01:49:44.970
Yes, then we will take
Rajaram and his wife, too.

01:49:45.220 --> 01:49:45.844
[chuckles]

01:49:45.845 --> 01:49:46.886
Great!

01:49:51.511 --> 01:49:53.261
[rousing music]

01:50:01.011 --> 01:50:06.845
<i>♪ When I wrote your name and erased it, ♪</i>

01:50:07.011 --> 01:50:10.761
<i>♪ I missed you. ♪</i>

01:50:11.386 --> 01:50:17.345
<i>♪ When I wrote your name and erased it, ♪</i>

01:50:17.511 --> 01:50:21.386
<i>♪ I missed you. ♪</i>

01:50:22.636 --> 01:50:28.386
<i>♪ When I embraced your photo, ♪</i>

01:50:30.595 --> 01:50:34.720
<i>♪ When I embraced your photo, ♪</i>

01:50:34.845 --> 01:50:39.886
<i>♪ I missed you. ♪</i>

01:50:40.136 --> 01:50:46.010
<i>♪ When I saw the moon hidden behind
the clouds, ♪</i>

01:50:46.011 --> 01:50:49.720
<i>♪ I missed you. ♪</i>

01:50:50.595 --> 01:50:56.470
<i>♪ When I wrote your name and erased it, ♪</i>

01:50:56.636 --> 01:51:00.595
<i>♪ I missed you. ♪</i>

01:51:27.845 --> 01:51:32.885
<i>♪ I never had seen such colours
in my life before. ♪</i>

01:51:32.886 --> 01:51:38.136
<i>♪ I never felt this way before. ♪</i>

01:51:38.345 --> 01:51:43.095
<i>♪ The paths were the same,
but they were never so lovely. ♪</i>

01:51:43.386 --> 01:51:50.511
<i>♪ Life had never touched me
this way before. ♪</i>

01:51:50.636 --> 01:51:55.345
<i>♪ All seasons seem beautiful now. ♪</i>

01:51:55.761 --> 01:52:00.720
<i>♪ Ever since you became mine, beloved. ♪</i>

01:52:00.970 --> 01:52:06.260
<i>♪ In my lonely life, ♪</i>

01:52:06.261 --> 01:52:11.011
<i>♪ you brought immense love. ♪</i>

